(671,623,$mw$06533064719BBE3BAFD3059F5872B5EFDC69395FF7198D2DD9D737924C6A5FF1$mw$,$mw$d446142b79c9ca987b35f01fd0fef70d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":623,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حل معادلة بمجهول داخل بسط كسر","TitleEn":"Solve a linear equation with a fraction","QuestionTextAr":"حل: (x + 6) ÷ 3 = 9.","QuestionTextEn":"Solve (x + 6) ÷ 3 = 9.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: الضرب يعكس القسمة. في (س + 6) ÷ 3 = 9 نضرب طرفي المعادلة في 3 لنحصل على س + 6 = 27. نطرح 6: س = 27 − 6 = 21. التحقق: (21 + 6) ÷ 3 = 9.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Multiplication undoes division. From (x + 6)/3 = 9, multiply both sides by 3 to obtain x + 6 = 27. Subtract 6: x = 27 − 6 = 21. Check: (21 + 6)/3 = 9.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2481,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2482,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2483,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2484,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"33","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإزالة المقام.","En":"Start by removing the denominator."},{"Ar":"اضرب الطرفين في 3 ثم اطرح 6.","En":"Multiply both sides by 3, then subtract 6."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حل معادلة بمجهول داخل بسط كسر","En":"Solve a linear equation with a fraction"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"3 يعطي 3 في الطرف الأيسر.","En":"3 gives 3 on the left."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"15 يعطي 7 لا 9.","En":"15 gives 7, not 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"33 يعطي 13 لا 9.","En":"33 gives 13, not 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"33"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"حل: (x + 6) ÷ 3 = 9.","En":"Solve (x + 6) ÷ 3 = 9."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعكس القسمة بالضرب ثم نعكس الجمع بالطرح.","En":"Reverse division by multiplication, then reverse addition by subtraction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب الطرفين في 3: $x+6=27$.","En":"Multiply both sides by 3: $x+6=27$."},{"Ar":"نطرح 6: $x=21$.","En":"Subtract 6: $x=21$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسم 9 على 3 مرة أخرى.","En":"Do not divide 9 by 3 again."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{x+a}{b}=c\\Rightarrow x=bc-a,\\quad b\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x+6=27\\Rightarrow x=21$","En":"$x+6=27\\Rightarrow x=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(21+6)/3=9$","En":"$(21+6)/3=9$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":25,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بإزالة المقام.","En":"Start by removing the denominator."},{"Ar":"اضرب الطرفين في 3 ثم اطرح 6.","En":"Multiply both sides by 3, then subtract 6."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعكس القسمة بالضرب ثم نعكس الجمع بالطرح.","En":"Reverse division by multiplication, then reverse addition by subtraction."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نضرب الطرفين في 3: $x+6=27$.","En":"Multiply both sides by 3: $x+6=27$."},{"Ar":"نطرح 6: $x=21$.","En":"Subtract 6: $x=21$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسم 9 على 3 مرة أخرى.","En":"Do not divide 9 by 3 again."},"FormulaLatex":"\\frac{x+a}{b}=c\\Rightarrow x=bc-a,\\quad b\\ne0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$x+6=27\\Rightarrow x=21$","En":"$x+6=27\\Rightarrow x=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(21+6)/3=9$","En":"$(21+6)/3=9$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3 يعطي 3 في الطرف الأيسر.","En":"3 gives 3 on the left."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"15 يعطي 7 لا 9.","En":"15 gives 7, not 9."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"33 يعطي 13 لا 9.","En":"33 gives 13, not 9."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعكس القسمة بالضرب ثم نعكس الجمع بالطرح.

$\frac{x+a}{b}=c\Rightarrow x=bc-a,\quad b\ne0$

1. نضرب الطرفين في 3: $x+6=27$.

2. نطرح 6: $x=21$.

$x+6=27\Rightarrow x=21$

$21$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(21+6)/3=9$

لا تقسم 9 على 3 مرة أخرى.$mw$,$mw$Reverse division by multiplication, then reverse addition by subtraction.

$\frac{x+a}{b}=c\Rightarrow x=bc-a,\quad b\ne0$

1. Multiply both sides by 3: $x+6=27$.

2. Subtract 6: $x=21$.

$x+6=27\Rightarrow x=21$

$21$ Dimensionless

$(21+6)/3=9$

Do not divide 9 by 3 again.$mw$),
(672,624,$mw$53C99F0282BA8A50340C50545C5FC81BB828A2D0045502268E7948257706DFF9$mw$,$mw$b159d0c3caea766d7f66e64bc208e7cb$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":624,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":6,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"صياغة معادلة خطية من تكلفة الشراء","TitleEn":"Model a purchase with a linear equation","QuestionTextAr":"ثمن 3 دفاتر متساوية السعر مع رسوم توصيل 5 وحدات هو 41 وحدة. ما ثمن الدفتر الواحد؟","QuestionTextEn":"Three equally priced notebooks plus 5 units for delivery cost 41 units in total. How much does one notebook cost?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: نحول المسألة الكلامية إلى معادلة ثم نعزل المجهول. إذا كان سعر الدفتر الواحد س، فإن ثمن 3 دفاتر مع توصيل 5 وحدات هو 3س + 5 = 41. نطرح 5 لنحصل على 3س = 36، ثم س = 36 ÷ 3 = 12 وحدة للدفتر. التحقق: 3 × 12 + 5 = 41.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Translate the word problem into an equation. Let x be the price of one notebook: 3x + 5 = 41 for three identical notebooks plus delivery. Subtract 5 to get 3x = 36; divide by 3: x = 12 units. Check: 3 × 12 + 5 = 41.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2485,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2486,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2487,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"14","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2488,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"افصل رسوم التوصيل عن ثمن الدفاتر.","En":"Separate delivery fees from notebook costs."},{"Ar":"اطرح التوصيل من الإجمالي ثم اقسم الباقي على عدد الدفاتر.","En":"Subtract delivery from the total and divide the remainder by the number of notebooks."}],"Title":{"Ar":"صياغة معادلة خطية من تكلفة الشراء","En":"Model a purchase with a linear equation"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"10 يعطي مجموعاً 35.","En":"10 gives a total of 35."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"12"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"14 يعطي مجموعاً 47.","En":"14 gives a total of 47."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"14"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"18 يعطي مجموعاً 59.","En":"18 gives a total of 59."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ثمن 3 دفاتر متساوية السعر مع رسوم توصيل 5 وحدات هو 41 وحدة. ما ثمن الدفتر الواحد؟","En":"Three equally priced notebooks plus 5 units for delivery cost 41 units in total. How much does one notebook cost?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الإجمالي يساوي ثلاثة أمثال سعر الدفتر مضافاً إليه التوصيل.","En":"The total is three times the notebook price plus delivery."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"لنرمز لسعر الدفتر بـ$x$؛ سعر الدفاتر الثلاثة $3x$ والتوصيل 5.","En":"Let $x$ be the notebook price; three cost $3x$ and delivery costs 5."},{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من 41 ثم نقسم على 3: $x=36/3=12$.","En":"Subtract 5 from 41, then divide by 3: $x=36/3=12$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسّم الإجمالي المتضمن التوصيل مباشرة.","En":"Do not divide the delivery-inclusive total directly."},"FormulaLatex":"3x+5=41","Substitution":{"Ar":"$3x=36\\Rightarrow x=12$","En":"$3x=36\\Rightarrow x=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times12+5=41$","En":"$3\\times12+5=41$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":6,"PrimarySkillId":25,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"افصل رسوم التوصيل عن ثمن الدفاتر.","En":"Separate delivery fees from notebook costs."},{"Ar":"اطرح التوصيل من الإجمالي ثم اقسم الباقي على عدد الدفاتر.","En":"Subtract delivery from the total and divide the remainder by the number of notebooks."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"السعر الإجمالي يساوي ثلاثة أمثال سعر الدفتر مضافاً إليه التوصيل.","En":"The total is three times the notebook price plus delivery."},"Unit":{"Ar":"وحدة نقدية","En":"currency units"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"لنرمز لسعر الدفتر بـ$x$؛ سعر الدفاتر الثلاثة $3x$ والتوصيل 5.","En":"Let $x$ be the notebook price; three cost $3x$ and delivery costs 5."},{"Ar":"نطرح 5 من 41 ثم نقسم على 3: $x=36/3=12$.","En":"Subtract 5 from 41, then divide by 3: $x=36/3=12$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12$","En":"$12$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسّم الإجمالي المتضمن التوصيل مباشرة.","En":"Do not divide the delivery-inclusive total directly."},"FormulaLatex":"3x+5=41","Substitution":{"Ar":"$3x=36\\Rightarrow x=12$","En":"$3x=36\\Rightarrow x=12$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times12+5=41$","En":"$3\\times12+5=41$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 يعطي مجموعاً 35.","En":"10 gives a total of 35."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"14 يعطي مجموعاً 47.","En":"14 gives a total of 47."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18 يعطي مجموعاً 59.","En":"18 gives a total of 59."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$السعر الإجمالي يساوي ثلاثة أمثال سعر الدفتر مضافاً إليه التوصيل.

$3x+5=41$

1. لنرمز لسعر الدفتر بـ$x$؛ سعر الدفاتر الثلاثة $3x$ والتوصيل 5.

2. نطرح 5 من 41 ثم نقسم على 3: $x=36/3=12$.

$3x=36\Rightarrow x=12$

$12$ وحدة نقدية

$3\times12+5=41$

لا تقسّم الإجمالي المتضمن التوصيل مباشرة.$mw$,$mw$The total is three times the notebook price plus delivery.

$3x+5=41$

1. Let $x$ be the notebook price; three cost $3x$ and delivery costs 5.

2. Subtract 5 from 41, then divide by 3: $x=36/3=12$.

$3x=36\Rightarrow x=12$

$12$ currency units

$3\times12+5=41$

Do not divide the delivery-inclusive total directly.$mw$),
(673,625,$mw$0B2B26B30F9A7A0C190C22864BAC26F10A6B0DD9178EAA146F43EBB8C3EF1769$mw$,$mw$43b0cbcf709510ee4b61ee61d71b9cd6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":625,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":8,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب مساحة دائرة بدلالة باي","TitleEn":"Find circle area in terms of pi","QuestionTextAr":"ما مساحة دائرة نصف قطرها 5 سم بدلالة π؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the area of a circle of radius 5 cm, expressed in terms of π?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مساحة الدائرة = π × (نصف القطر)². بما أن نصف القطر 5 سم، فإن المساحة = π × 5² = π × 25 = 25π سم². أبقينا الناتج بدلالة π لأن السؤال لم يطلب تقريباً عشرياً.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Circle area A = πr². With radius r = 5 cm, substitute A = π × 5² = π × 25 = 25π cm². We leave π symbolic because the question requests an exact answer in terms of π.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2489,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"10\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2490,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"25\\pi","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2491,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"5\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2492,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"50\\pi","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قانون المساحة لا المحيط.","En":"Use the area rule rather than circumference."},{"Ar":"ربّع نصف القطر واترك باي رمزياً.","En":"Square the radius and leave pi symbolic."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب مساحة دائرة بدلالة باي","En":"Find circle area in terms of pi"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"هذا محيط الدائرة لا مساحتها.","En":"This is the circumference, not the area."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10\\pi"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"25\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"لم يربع نصف القطر.","En":"The radius was not squared."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ضاعف المساحة الصحيحة.","En":"Doubles the correct area."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"50\\pi"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"ما مساحة دائرة نصف قطرها 5 سم بدلالة π؟","En":"What is the area of a circle of radius 5 cm, expressed in terms of π?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مساحة الدائرة تساوي باي في مربع نصف القطر.","En":"Circle area equals pi times the radius squared."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نصف القطر 5 سم؛ قانون المساحة يربع نصف القطر.","En":"The radius is 5 cm; the area formula squares the radius."},{"Ar":"$A=\\pi(5)^2=25\\pi$ سم².","En":"$A=\\pi(5)^2=25\\pi$ cm²."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$25\\pi$","En":"$25\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم 2πr للمساحة.","En":"Do not use 2πr for area."},"FormulaLatex":"A=\\pi r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$A=\\pi\\times5^2=25\\pi$","En":"$A=\\pi\\times5^2=25\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$A/\\pi=5^2$","En":"$A/\\pi=5^2$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":8,"PrimarySkillId":36,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل قانون المساحة لا المحيط.","En":"Use the area rule rather than circumference."},{"Ar":"ربّع نصف القطر واترك باي رمزياً.","En":"Square the radius and leave pi symbolic."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مساحة الدائرة تساوي باي في مربع نصف القطر.","En":"Circle area equals pi times the radius squared."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نصف القطر 5 سم؛ قانون المساحة يربع نصف القطر.","En":"The radius is 5 cm; the area formula squares the radius."},{"Ar":"$A=\\pi(5)^2=25\\pi$ سم².","En":"$A=\\pi(5)^2=25\\pi$ cm²."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$25\\pi$","En":"$25\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستخدم 2πr للمساحة.","En":"Do not use 2πr for area."},"FormulaLatex":"A=\\pi r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$A=\\pi\\times5^2=25\\pi$","En":"$A=\\pi\\times5^2=25\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$A/\\pi=5^2$","En":"$A/\\pi=5^2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"هذا محيط الدائرة لا مساحتها.","En":"This is the circumference, not the area."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"لم يربع نصف القطر.","En":"The radius was not squared."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ضاعف المساحة الصحيحة.","En":"Doubles the correct area."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مساحة الدائرة تساوي باي في مربع نصف القطر.

$A=\pi r^2$

1. نصف القطر 5 سم؛ قانون المساحة يربع نصف القطر.

2. $A=\pi(5)^2=25\pi$ سم².

$A=\pi\times5^2=25\pi$

$25\pi$ سم²

$A/\pi=5^2$

لا تستخدم 2πr للمساحة.$mw$,$mw$Circle area equals pi times the radius squared.

$A=\pi r^2$

1. The radius is 5 cm; the area formula squares the radius.

2. $A=\pi(5)^2=25\pi$ cm².

$A=\pi\times5^2=25\pi$

$25\pi$ cm²

$A/\pi=5^2$

Do not use 2πr for area.$mw$),
(674,626,$mw$17A0095F5951B8C1C0010840CE118DE7D8E06AE280E477E5BD6955E0528F3291$mw$,$mw$eb64409136f30cc33c41c45c17913cb6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":626,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":8,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخراج نصف القطر من القطر قبل حساب المساحة","TitleEn":"Find the radius from diameter to calculate area","QuestionTextAr":"قطر دائرة 18 سم. ما مساحتها بدلالة π؟","QuestionTextEn":"A circle's diameter is 18 cm. What is its area in terms of π?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: نصف القطر = القطر ÷ 2، ومساحة الدائرة = πr². القطر 18 سم، لذلك نصف القطر 18 ÷ 2 = 9 سم. بالتعويض: π × 9² = 81π سم². لا نستخدم القطر 18 مكان نصف القطر في القانون.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Radius = diameter ÷ 2 and circle area A = πr². A diameter of 18 cm gives radius 9 cm. Substitute A = π × 9² = 81π cm². Using 18 instead of the radius would be incorrect.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2493,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"18\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2494,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"36\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2495,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"81\\pi","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2496,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"324\\pi","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"فرّق بين القطر ونصف القطر.","En":"Distinguish diameter and radius."},{"Ar":"اقسم القطر على اثنين قبل تربيع نصف القطر.","En":"Halve the diameter before squaring the radius."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخراج نصف القطر من القطر قبل حساب المساحة","En":"Find the radius from diameter to calculate area"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"18π هو المحيط.","En":"18π is the circumference."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"36π لا يساوي مربع نصف القطر مضروباً في π.","En":"36π is not π times the squared radius."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"36\\pi"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"81\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"ربع القطر بدلاً من نصف القطر.","En":"Squares the diameter instead of the radius."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"324\\pi"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"قطر دائرة 18 سم. ما مساحتها بدلالة π؟","En":"A circle's diameter is 18 cm. What is its area in terms of π?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نصف القطر يساوي نصف طول القطر، ثم نطبق قانون المساحة.","En":"The radius is half the diameter; then apply the area formula."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم القطر 18 على 2 فنحصل على نصف القطر 9 سم.","En":"Halve diameter 18 to obtain radius 9 cm."},{"Ar":"$A=\\pi(9)^2=81\\pi$ سم².","En":"$A=\\pi(9)^2=81\\pi$ cm²."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$81\\pi$","En":"$81\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تربّع القطر كاملاً.","En":"Do not square the full diameter."},"FormulaLatex":"r=d/2,\\quad A=\\pi r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$r=18/2=9,\\quad A=\\pi\\times9^2=81\\pi$","En":"$r=18/2=9,\\quad A=\\pi\\times9^2=81\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\sqrt{81}=18$","En":"$2\\sqrt{81}=18$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":8,"PrimarySkillId":36,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"فرّق بين القطر ونصف القطر.","En":"Distinguish diameter and radius."},{"Ar":"اقسم القطر على اثنين قبل تربيع نصف القطر.","En":"Halve the diameter before squaring the radius."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نصف القطر يساوي نصف طول القطر، ثم نطبق قانون المساحة.","En":"The radius is half the diameter; then apply the area formula."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم القطر 18 على 2 فنحصل على نصف القطر 9 سم.","En":"Halve diameter 18 to obtain radius 9 cm."},{"Ar":"$A=\\pi(9)^2=81\\pi$ سم².","En":"$A=\\pi(9)^2=81\\pi$ cm²."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$81\\pi$","En":"$81\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تربّع القطر كاملاً.","En":"Do not square the full diameter."},"FormulaLatex":"r=d/2,\\quad A=\\pi r^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$r=18/2=9,\\quad A=\\pi\\times9^2=81\\pi$","En":"$r=18/2=9,\\quad A=\\pi\\times9^2=81\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\sqrt{81}=18$","En":"$2\\sqrt{81}=18$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18π هو المحيط.","En":"18π is the circumference."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"36π لا يساوي مربع نصف القطر مضروباً في π.","En":"36π is not π times the squared radius."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"ربع القطر بدلاً من نصف القطر.","En":"Squares the diameter instead of the radius."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نصف القطر يساوي نصف طول القطر، ثم نطبق قانون المساحة.

$r=d/2,\quad A=\pi r^2$

1. نقسم القطر 18 على 2 فنحصل على نصف القطر 9 سم.

2. $A=\pi(9)^2=81\pi$ سم².

$r=18/2=9,\quad A=\pi\times9^2=81\pi$

$81\pi$ سم²

$2\sqrt{81}=18$

لا تربّع القطر كاملاً.$mw$,$mw$The radius is half the diameter; then apply the area formula.

$r=d/2,\quad A=\pi r^2$

1. Halve diameter 18 to obtain radius 9 cm.

2. $A=\pi(9)^2=81\pi$ cm².

$r=18/2=9,\quad A=\pi\times9^2=81\pi$

$81\pi$ cm²

$2\sqrt{81}=18$

Do not square the full diameter.$mw$),
(675,627,$mw$F8592BCCE76E2C2609448B57FCC411B32AB41F8F240899D32AA235AC27B6126C$mw$,$mw$35df601ddf89caed6a75ae45361d5040$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":627,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":8,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب نصف مساحة دائرة","TitleEn":"Calculate a semicircle's area","QuestionTextAr":"مساحة نصف دائرة نصف قطرها 6 سم تساوي كم بدلالة π؟","QuestionTextEn":"A semicircle has radius 6 cm. What is its area in terms of π?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مساحة نصف الدائرة = نصف مساحة الدائرة الكاملة = (πr²) ÷ 2. نصف القطر 6 سم؛ أولاً مساحة الدائرة = π × 6² = 36π سم²، ثم مساحة نصفها = 36π ÷ 2 = 18π سم².","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A semicircle has half the area of a full circle: A = πr²/2. With r = 6 cm, full-circle area is π × 6² = 36π cm². Half is 36π ÷ 2 = 18π cm².","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2497,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2498,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"12\\pi","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2499,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"18\\pi","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2500,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"36\\pi","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بمساحة الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"Start with the full circle's area."},{"Ar":"ربّع نصف القطر واضرب بباي ثم خذ النصف.","En":"Square the radius, multiply by pi, then halve."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب نصف مساحة دائرة","En":"Calculate a semicircle's area"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"9π ربع مساحة الدائرة لا نصفها.","En":"9π is a quarter of the circle, not half."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"12π محيط الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"12π is the full circle circumference."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"12\\pi"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"18\\pi"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"36π مساحة الدائرة كاملة.","En":"36π is the full circle area."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"36\\pi"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"مساحة نصف دائرة نصف قطرها 6 سم تساوي كم بدلالة π؟","En":"A semicircle has radius 6 cm. What is its area in terms of π?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نصف الدائرة له نصف مساحة الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"A semicircle has half the area of the full circle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مساحة الدائرة الكاملة $\\pi(6)^2=36\\pi$.","En":"The full circle area is $\\pi(6)^2=36\\pi$."},{"Ar":"نقسم المساحة على 2: $36\\pi/2=18\\pi$.","En":"Halve the area: $36\\pi/2=18\\pi$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$18\\pi$","En":"$18\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس قسمة المساحة على اثنين.","En":"Do not forget to halve the area."},"FormulaLatex":"A_{\\mathrm{semi}}=\\pi r^2/2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\pi\\times6^2/2=18\\pi$","En":"$\\pi\\times6^2/2=18\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times18\\pi=36\\pi$","En":"$2\\times18\\pi=36\\pi$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":8,"PrimarySkillId":36,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"ابدأ بمساحة الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"Start with the full circle's area."},{"Ar":"ربّع نصف القطر واضرب بباي ثم خذ النصف.","En":"Square the radius, multiply by pi, then halve."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نصف الدائرة له نصف مساحة الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"A semicircle has half the area of the full circle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم²","En":"cm²"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مساحة الدائرة الكاملة $\\pi(6)^2=36\\pi$.","En":"The full circle area is $\\pi(6)^2=36\\pi$."},{"Ar":"نقسم المساحة على 2: $36\\pi/2=18\\pi$.","En":"Halve the area: $36\\pi/2=18\\pi$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$18\\pi$","En":"$18\\pi$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تنس قسمة المساحة على اثنين.","En":"Do not forget to halve the area."},"FormulaLatex":"A_{\\mathrm{semi}}=\\pi r^2/2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\pi\\times6^2/2=18\\pi$","En":"$\\pi\\times6^2/2=18\\pi$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$2\\times18\\pi=36\\pi$","En":"$2\\times18\\pi=36\\pi$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9π ربع مساحة الدائرة لا نصفها.","En":"9π is a quarter of the circle, not half."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12π محيط الدائرة الكاملة.","En":"12π is the full circle circumference."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"36π مساحة الدائرة كاملة.","En":"36π is the full circle area."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نصف الدائرة له نصف مساحة الدائرة الكاملة.

$A_{\mathrm{semi}}=\pi r^2/2$

1. مساحة الدائرة الكاملة $\pi(6)^2=36\pi$.

2. نقسم المساحة على 2: $36\pi/2=18\pi$.

$\pi\times6^2/2=18\pi$

$18\pi$ سم²

$2\times18\pi=36\pi$

لا تنس قسمة المساحة على اثنين.$mw$,$mw$A semicircle has half the area of the full circle.

$A_{\mathrm{semi}}=\pi r^2/2$

1. The full circle area is $\pi(6)^2=36\pi$.

2. Halve the area: $36\pi/2=18\pi$.

$\pi\times6^2/2=18\pi$

$18\pi$ cm²

$2\times18\pi=36\pi$

Do not forget to halve the area.$mw$),
(676,628,$mw$0A0478F86D5261942B8B878AF0486DE887679D696385D0641B348C1F5604D992$mw$,$mw$69bfba418ac63de46500cb96c071b334$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":628,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":8,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تحديد نصف قطر دائرة معلومة المساحة","TitleEn":"Recover circle radius from area","QuestionTextAr":"مساحة دائرة 64π سم². كم طول نصف قطرها بالسنتيمتر؟","QuestionTextEn":"A circle's area is 64π cm². What is its radius in centimeters?","DetailedSolutionAr":"القانون المستخدم: مساحة الدائرة = πr². إذا كانت المساحة 64π سم²، نحل πr² = 64π بقسمة الطرفين على π لنحصل على r² = 64. لأن نصف القطر طول غير سالب، r = √64 = 8 سم. التحقق: π × 8² = 64π.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Circle area A = πr². From 64π = πr², divide by π to obtain r² = 64. Radius is nonnegative, so r = √64 = 8 cm. Check: π × 8² = 64π.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2501,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2502,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2503,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2504,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"32","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اعزل مربع نصف القطر.","En":"Isolate the radius squared."},{"Ar":"اقسم المساحة على باي ثم خذ الجذر الموجب.","En":"Divide area by pi and take the positive square root."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تحديد نصف قطر دائرة معلومة المساحة","En":"Recover circle radius from area"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 يعطي مساحة 16π.","En":"4 gives area 16π."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"16 هو القطر لا نصف القطر.","En":"16 is the diameter, not the radius."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"16"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"32 يعطي مساحة 1024π.","En":"32 gives area 1024π."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"32"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"مساحة دائرة 64π سم². كم طول نصف قطرها بالسنتيمتر؟","En":"A circle's area is 64π cm². What is its radius in centimeters?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعيد ترتيب قانون مساحة الدائرة لإيجاد نصف القطر الموجب.","En":"Rearrange the circle area formula to find the positive radius."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم المساحة على $\\pi$ فنحصل على $r^2=64$.","En":"Divide area by $\\pi$ to get $r^2=64$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن نصف القطر طول: r=8.","En":"Take the positive root because radius is a length: r=8."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك قيمة مربع نصف القطر جواباً.","En":"Do not report the radius squared."},"FormulaLatex":"r=\\sqrt{A/\\pi}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$r^2=64\\Rightarrow r=8$","En":"$r^2=64\\Rightarrow r=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\pi\\times8^2=64\\pi$","En":"$\\pi\\times8^2=64\\pi$"}},"TrackIds":[8],"CategoryId":8,"PrimarySkillId":36,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اعزل مربع نصف القطر.","En":"Isolate the radius squared."},{"Ar":"اقسم المساحة على باي ثم خذ الجذر الموجب.","En":"Divide area by pi and take the positive square root."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"نعيد ترتيب قانون مساحة الدائرة لإيجاد نصف القطر الموجب.","En":"Rearrange the circle area formula to find the positive radius."},"Unit":{"Ar":"سم","En":"cm"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نقسم المساحة على $\\pi$ فنحصل على $r^2=64$.","En":"Divide area by $\\pi$ to get $r^2=64$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن نصف القطر طول: r=8.","En":"Take the positive root because radius is a length: r=8."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$8$","En":"$8$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك قيمة مربع نصف القطر جواباً.","En":"Do not report the radius squared."},"FormulaLatex":"r=\\sqrt{A/\\pi}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$r^2=64\\Rightarrow r=8$","En":"$r^2=64\\Rightarrow r=8$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\pi\\times8^2=64\\pi$","En":"$\\pi\\times8^2=64\\pi$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 يعطي مساحة 16π.","En":"4 gives area 16π."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"16 هو القطر لا نصف القطر.","En":"16 is the diameter, not the radius."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"32 يعطي مساحة 1024π.","En":"32 gives area 1024π."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$نعيد ترتيب قانون مساحة الدائرة لإيجاد نصف القطر الموجب.

$r=\sqrt{A/\pi}$

1. نقسم المساحة على $\pi$ فنحصل على $r^2=64$.

2. نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن نصف القطر طول: r=8.

$r^2=64\Rightarrow r=8$

$8$ سم

$\pi\times8^2=64\pi$

لا تترك قيمة مربع نصف القطر جواباً.$mw$,$mw$Rearrange the circle area formula to find the positive radius.

$r=\sqrt{A/\pi}$

1. Divide area by $\pi$ to get $r^2=64$.

2. Take the positive root because radius is a length: r=8.

$r^2=64\Rightarrow r=8$

$8$ cm

$\pi\times8^2=64\pi$

Do not report the radius squared.$mw$),
(677,629,$mw$9B4CF6FF928F9A6F2C9E3C69E47F1F691A479472B3EA3B2F1D3DFF098DBE2C50$mw$,$mw$9dc683429fbb890926792553ac780855$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":629,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تقسيم كمية وفق نسبة ذات مجموع أجزاء","TitleEn":"Divide a total according to a ratio","QuestionTextAr":"نسبة الكرات الزرقاء إلى الخضراء 2 : 7، ومجموع الكرات 45. كم كرة زرقاء؟","QuestionTextEn":"Blue to green balls are in the ratio 2 : 7, with 45 balls total. How many are blue?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: عند معرفة العدد الكلي ونسبة مجموعتين، نجمع أجزاء النسبة ثم نحسب قيمة الجزء. نسبة الأزرق إلى الأخضر 2 : 7، ومجموع الأجزاء 2 + 7 = 9. الكرات 45، فقيمة الجزء = 45 ÷ 9 = 5؛ الزرقاء = 2 × 5 = 10 كرات. التحقق: الخضراء 7 × 5 = 35 والمجموع 45.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: To divide a known total in a ratio, sum the ratio parts and find the value of one part. For blue:green = 2:7, total parts = 2 + 7 = 9; one part = 45 ÷ 9 = 5. Blue = 2 × 5 = 10 balls. Check: green = 7 × 5 = 35 and total = 45.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2505,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2506,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2507,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"14","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2508,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"35","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مجموع أجزاء النسبة.","En":"Find the total number of ratio parts."},{"Ar":"اقسم الإجمالي على مجموع الأجزاء واضرب بعدد أجزاء اللون الأزرق.","En":"Divide the total by the total parts, then multiply by the blue parts."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تقسيم كمية وفق نسبة ذات مجموع أجزاء","En":"Divide a total according to a ratio"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"9 عدد أجزاء النسبة وليس الكرات الزرقاء.","En":"9 is the number of ratio parts, not blue balls."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"14 لا يحقق نسبة 2 إلى 7 مع الباقي 31.","En":"14 does not give ratio 2 to 7 with the remaining 31."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"14"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"35 عدد الكرات الخضراء.","En":"35 is the green count."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"35"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"نسبة الكرات الزرقاء إلى الخضراء 2 : 7، ومجموع الكرات 45. كم كرة زرقاء؟","En":"Blue to green balls are in the ratio 2 : 7, with 45 balls total. How many are blue?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مجموع أجزاء النسبة يمثل العدد الكلي.","En":"The sum of ratio parts represents the total."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كرات","En":"balls"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مجموع أجزاء النسبة 2+7=9؛ قيمة الجزء الواحد 45/9=5.","En":"The ratio has 2+7=9 parts; one part is 45/9=5."},{"Ar":"الأزرق يمثل جزأين، أي 2×5=10 كرات.","En":"Blue represents two parts, so 2×5=10 balls."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسّم على أحد الحدين وحده.","En":"Do not divide by just one ratio term."},"FormulaLatex":"B=T\\frac{a}{a+b}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$45\\frac{2}{2+7}=10$","En":"$45\\frac{2}{2+7}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10+35=45,\\quad10:35=2:7$","En":"$10+35=45,\\quad10:35=2:7$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":30,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مجموع أجزاء النسبة.","En":"Find the total number of ratio parts."},{"Ar":"اقسم الإجمالي على مجموع الأجزاء واضرب بعدد أجزاء اللون الأزرق.","En":"Divide the total by the total parts, then multiply by the blue parts."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"مجموع أجزاء النسبة يمثل العدد الكلي.","En":"The sum of ratio parts represents the total."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كرات","En":"balls"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"مجموع أجزاء النسبة 2+7=9؛ قيمة الجزء الواحد 45/9=5.","En":"The ratio has 2+7=9 parts; one part is 45/9=5."},{"Ar":"الأزرق يمثل جزأين، أي 2×5=10 كرات.","En":"Blue represents two parts, so 2×5=10 balls."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$10$","En":"$10$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تقسّم على أحد الحدين وحده.","En":"Do not divide by just one ratio term."},"FormulaLatex":"B=T\\frac{a}{a+b}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$45\\frac{2}{2+7}=10$","En":"$45\\frac{2}{2+7}=10$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$10+35=45,\\quad10:35=2:7$","En":"$10+35=45,\\quad10:35=2:7$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9 عدد أجزاء النسبة وليس الكرات الزرقاء.","En":"9 is the number of ratio parts, not blue balls."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"14 لا يحقق نسبة 2 إلى 7 مع الباقي 31.","En":"14 does not give ratio 2 to 7 with the remaining 31."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"35 عدد الكرات الخضراء.","En":"35 is the green count."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$مجموع أجزاء النسبة يمثل العدد الكلي.

$B=T\frac{a}{a+b}$

1. مجموع أجزاء النسبة 2+7=9؛ قيمة الجزء الواحد 45/9=5.

2. الأزرق يمثل جزأين، أي 2×5=10 كرات.

$45\frac{2}{2+7}=10$

$10$ كرات

$10+35=45,\quad10:35=2:7$

لا تقسّم على أحد الحدين وحده.$mw$,$mw$The sum of ratio parts represents the total.

$B=T\frac{a}{a+b}$

1. The ratio has 2+7=9 parts; one part is 45/9=5.

2. Blue represents two parts, so 2×5=10 balls.

$45\frac{2}{2+7}=10$

$10$ balls

$10+35=45,\quad10:35=2:7$

Do not divide by just one ratio term.$mw$),
(678,630,$mw$70D94D324F234154666F58C9F20B55FEB3529485B28DEFCD004A5793772FEC74$mw$,$mw$25d15ef68b68a9c96b7221f9b36f638c$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":630,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"إيجاد مقدار آخر من خلال جزء معلوم من نسبة","TitleEn":"Find an unknown quantity from a known ratio part","QuestionTextAr":"نسبة عدد الكتب العربية إلى الإنكليزية 5 : 3، وإذا كان عدد العربية 35، فكم كتاباً إنكليزياً؟","QuestionTextEn":"Arabic to English books have ratio 5 : 3. If there are 35 Arabic books, how many English books are there?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: النسبة 5 : 3 تمثل خمسة أجزاء للكتب العربية وثلاثة للإنجليزية. إذا كانت الكتب العربية 35، فقيمة الجزء = 35 ÷ 5 = 7 كتب. إذن الكتب الإنجليزية = 3 × 7 = 21 كتاباً. لا نقسم 35 على مجموع الأجزاء لأن 35 يمثل فئة واحدة لا المجموع.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: A 5:3 Arabic-to-English book ratio gives 5 parts for Arabic and 3 for English. Since the five Arabic parts total 35, one part is 35 ÷ 5 = 7 books. English books = 3 × 7 = 21. The 35 books are not the whole collection.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2509,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2510,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"21","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2511,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"28","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2512,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"35","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد أي حد يمثل الكتب العربية.","En":"Identify the Arabic-books term."},{"Ar":"أوجد قيمة الجزء الواحد من عدد الكتب العربية ثم اضرب بأجزاء الإنجليزية.","En":"Find one part from the Arabic count, then multiply by the English parts."}],"Title":{"Ar":"إيجاد مقدار آخر من خلال جزء معلوم من نسبة","En":"Find an unknown quantity from a known ratio part"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"15 لا يحقق النسبة 35:15=7:3.","En":"15 gives 35:15=7:3, not 5:3."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"21"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"28 يمثل أربعة أجزاء لا ثلاثة.","En":"28 represents four parts, not three."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"28"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"35 عدد الكتب العربية.","En":"35 counts Arabic books."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"35"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"نسبة عدد الكتب العربية إلى الإنكليزية 5 : 3، وإذا كان عدد العربية 35، فكم كتاباً إنكليزياً؟","En":"Arabic to English books have ratio 5 : 3. If there are 35 Arabic books, how many English books are there?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تتغير كميتا النسبة بعامل واحد.","En":"The two ratio quantities scale by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كتاباً","En":"books"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"خمسة أجزاء تقابل 35 كتاباً عربياً، فيساوي الجزء 7 كتب.","En":"Five parts represent 35 Arabic books, so one part is 7 books."},{"Ar":"ثلاثة أجزاء للإنكليزية: 3×7=21.","En":"English books have three parts: 3×7=21."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب النسبة.","En":"Do not reverse the ratio."},"FormulaLatex":"E=A\\frac{b}{a}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$35/5=7,\\quad 7\\times3=21$","En":"$35/5=7,\\quad 7\\times3=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$35:21=5:3$","En":"$35:21=5:3$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":30,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حدد أي حد يمثل الكتب العربية.","En":"Identify the Arabic-books term."},{"Ar":"أوجد قيمة الجزء الواحد من عدد الكتب العربية ثم اضرب بأجزاء الإنجليزية.","En":"Find one part from the Arabic count, then multiply by the English parts."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تتغير كميتا النسبة بعامل واحد.","En":"The two ratio quantities scale by the same factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"كتاباً","En":"books"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"خمسة أجزاء تقابل 35 كتاباً عربياً، فيساوي الجزء 7 كتب.","En":"Five parts represent 35 Arabic books, so one part is 7 books."},{"Ar":"ثلاثة أجزاء للإنكليزية: 3×7=21.","En":"English books have three parts: 3×7=21."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$21$","En":"$21$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تعكس ترتيب النسبة.","En":"Do not reverse the ratio."},"FormulaLatex":"E=A\\frac{b}{a}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$35/5=7,\\quad 7\\times3=21$","En":"$35/5=7,\\quad 7\\times3=21$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$35:21=5:3$","En":"$35:21=5:3$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"15 لا يحقق النسبة 35:15=7:3.","En":"15 gives 35:15=7:3, not 5:3."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"28 يمثل أربعة أجزاء لا ثلاثة.","En":"28 represents four parts, not three."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"35 عدد الكتب العربية.","En":"35 counts Arabic books."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تتغير كميتا النسبة بعامل واحد.

$E=A\frac{b}{a}$

1. خمسة أجزاء تقابل 35 كتاباً عربياً، فيساوي الجزء 7 كتب.

2. ثلاثة أجزاء للإنكليزية: 3×7=21.

$35/5=7,\quad 7\times3=21$

$21$ كتاباً

$35:21=5:3$

لا تعكس ترتيب النسبة.$mw$,$mw$The two ratio quantities scale by the same factor.

$E=A\frac{b}{a}$

1. Five parts represent 35 Arabic books, so one part is 7 books.

2. English books have three parts: 3×7=21.

$35/5=7,\quad 7\times3=21$

$21$ books

$35:21=5:3$

Do not reverse the ratio.$mw$),
(679,631,$mw$AF1A3641D1BF175A01ADD7508C413C3E50847B2A44AF5377B4FE89826F032371$mw$,$mw$8dcfecaa1421f400d0bbdaed404a8df7$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":631,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"مقارنة نسبتين من أجل استخراج الكمية الأصغر","TitleEn":"Use the larger ratio part to find the smaller","QuestionTextAr":"نسبة أقلام التلوين الصفراء إلى الزرقاء 4 : 9. إذا كان عدد الزرقاء 36، فما عدد الصفراء؟","QuestionTextEn":"Yellow to blue coloring pencils have a 4 : 9 ratio. If there are 36 blue pencils, how many yellow?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: في النسبة أصفر : أزرق = 4 : 9، تمثل 9 أجزاء الأقلام الزرقاء وعددها 36. إذن قيمة الجزء = 36 ÷ 9 = 4 أقلام. عدد الأقلام الصفراء = 4 أجزاء × 4 = 16 قلماً. التحقق: 16 : 36 تبسط بقسمة الطرفين على 4 إلى 4 : 9.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: In yellow:blue = 4:9, the 9 blue parts represent 36 pencils. One part = 36 ÷ 9 = 4 pencils. Yellow pencils = 4 parts × 4 = 16. Check: 16:36 simplifies to 4:9.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2513,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"9","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2514,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2515,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"16","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2516,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"24","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"اربط 36 بالحد الموافق للأزرق.","En":"Match 36 to the blue ratio term."},{"Ar":"اقسم عدد الأزرق على أجزائه واضرب في أجزاء الأصفر.","En":"Divide the blue count by its parts and multiply by the yellow parts."}],"Title":{"Ar":"مقارنة نسبتين من أجل استخراج الكمية الأصغر","En":"Use the larger ratio part to find the smaller"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"9 عدد أجزاء اللون الأزرق.","En":"9 is the blue ratio part count."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"9"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"12 يمثل ثلاثة أجزاء فقط.","En":"12 represents only three parts."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"12"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"16"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"24 يمثل ستة أجزاء لا أربعة.","En":"24 represents six parts, not four."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"24"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"نسبة أقلام التلوين الصفراء إلى الزرقاء 4 : 9. إذا كان عدد الزرقاء 36، فما عدد الصفراء؟","En":"Yellow to blue coloring pencils have a 4 : 9 ratio. If there are 36 blue pencils, how many yellow?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النسبة بين اللونين ثابتة؛ نستخدم عامل التكبير المشترك.","En":"The color ratio is fixed; use the common scaling factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"قلماً","En":"pencils"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"تسعة أجزاء زرقاء تقابل 36، فيكون الجزء 4 أقلام.","En":"Nine blue parts represent 36, so one part is 4 pencils."},{"Ar":"الأصفر أربعة أجزاء: 4×4=16.","En":"Yellow has four parts: 4×4=16."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$16$","En":"$16$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل مجموع أجزاء النسبة كأنه إجمالي معروف.","En":"Do not treat the total ratio parts as a known total."},"FormulaLatex":"Y=B\\frac{a}{b}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$36/9=4,\\quad4\\times4=16$","En":"$36/9=4,\\quad4\\times4=16$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$16:36=4:9$","En":"$16:36=4:9$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":30,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"اربط 36 بالحد الموافق للأزرق.","En":"Match 36 to the blue ratio term."},{"Ar":"اقسم عدد الأزرق على أجزائه واضرب في أجزاء الأصفر.","En":"Divide the blue count by its parts and multiply by the yellow parts."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"النسبة بين اللونين ثابتة؛ نستخدم عامل التكبير المشترك.","En":"The color ratio is fixed; use the common scaling factor."},"Unit":{"Ar":"قلماً","En":"pencils"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"تسعة أجزاء زرقاء تقابل 36، فيكون الجزء 4 أقلام.","En":"Nine blue parts represent 36, so one part is 4 pencils."},{"Ar":"الأصفر أربعة أجزاء: 4×4=16.","En":"Yellow has four parts: 4×4=16."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$16$","En":"$16$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل مجموع أجزاء النسبة كأنه إجمالي معروف.","En":"Do not treat the total ratio parts as a known total."},"FormulaLatex":"Y=B\\frac{a}{b}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$36/9=4,\\quad4\\times4=16$","En":"$36/9=4,\\quad4\\times4=16$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$16:36=4:9$","En":"$16:36=4:9$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"9 عدد أجزاء اللون الأزرق.","En":"9 is the blue ratio part count."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"12 يمثل ثلاثة أجزاء فقط.","En":"12 represents only three parts."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"24 يمثل ستة أجزاء لا أربعة.","En":"24 represents six parts, not four."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$النسبة بين اللونين ثابتة؛ نستخدم عامل التكبير المشترك.

$Y=B\frac{a}{b}$

1. تسعة أجزاء زرقاء تقابل 36، فيكون الجزء 4 أقلام.

2. الأصفر أربعة أجزاء: 4×4=16.

$36/9=4,\quad4\times4=16$

$16$ قلماً

$16:36=4:9$

لا تستعمل مجموع أجزاء النسبة كأنه إجمالي معروف.$mw$,$mw$The color ratio is fixed; use the common scaling factor.

$Y=B\frac{a}{b}$

1. Nine blue parts represent 36, so one part is 4 pencils.

2. Yellow has four parts: 4×4=16.

$36/9=4,\quad4\times4=16$

$16$ pencils

$16:36=4:9$

Do not treat the total ratio parts as a known total.$mw$),
(680,632,$mw$1ABB96768DB76CCBDB89019602DFDDBC0F4C2DA61F55CB72D18356675DA54D5D$mw$,$mw$6245dfd17e260405c76e4dbead7a70bf$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":632,"StageId":2,"CategoryId":7,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام نسبة تركيب وصفة مع تكبير الكمية","TitleEn":"Scale a recipe proportionally","QuestionTextAr":"تحتاج وصفة إلى 3 أكواب من الأرز لكل 5 أكواب ماء. كم كوب ماء نحتاج عند استخدام 12 كوب أرز؟","QuestionTextEn":"A recipe uses 3 cups of rice for every 5 cups of water. How many cups of water are needed for 12 cups of rice?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: النسب المتناسبة تتغير بضرب طرفي النسبة في العامل نفسه. الوصفة تحتاج 3 أكواب أرز مقابل 5 أكواب ماء. للحصول على 12 كوب أرز، عامل التكبير = 12 ÷ 3 = 4. إذن الماء = 5 × 4 = 20 كوباً، ونسبة 12 : 20 تساوي 3 : 5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Equivalent ratios multiply both parts by the same scale factor. A recipe needs rice:water = 3:5. To reach 12 cups of rice, multiply by 12 ÷ 3 = 4. Water needed = 5 × 4 = 20 cups. Check: 12:20 simplifies to 3:5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2517,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"15","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2518,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2519,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"20","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2520,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"24","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل نسبة الأرز إلى الماء.","En":"Use the rice-to-water ratio."},{"Ar":"حدد عامل تكبير كمية الأرز ثم طبقه على الماء.","En":"Find the scaling factor for rice and apply it to water."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام نسبة تركيب وصفة مع تكبير الكمية","En":"Scale a recipe proportionally"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"15 يمثل ثلاث وصفات، أي 9 أكواب أرز.","En":"15 corresponds to three batches and 9 cups of rice."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"15"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"18 لا يحافظ على النسبة 3:5.","En":"18 does not preserve ratio 3:5."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"20"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"24 يضاعف الأرز دون استخدام نسبة الماء الصحيحة.","En":"24 doubles the rice amount rather than applying the water ratio."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"24"}],"StageId":2,"Question":{"Ar":"تحتاج وصفة إلى 3 أكواب من الأرز لكل 5 أكواب ماء. كم كوب ماء نحتاج عند استخدام 12 كوب أرز؟","En":"A recipe uses 3 cups of rice for every 5 cups of water. How many cups of water are needed for 12 cups of rice?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"كميتا الوصفة تتناسبان طردياً.","En":"Recipe quantities are directly proportional."},"Unit":{"Ar":"أكواب","En":"cups"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عامل التكبير من 3 إلى 12 هو 4.","En":"The scale factor from 3 to 12 is 4."},{"Ar":"نضرب كمية الماء في العامل نفسه: 5×4=20.","En":"Multiply the water quantity by the same factor: 5×4=20."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف فرق الكميتين بدلاً من استخدام النسبة.","En":"Do not add the difference instead of scaling."},"FormulaLatex":"W=R\\frac53","Substitution":{"Ar":"$12/3=4,\\quad4\\times5=20$","En":"$12/3=4,\\quad4\\times5=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$12:20=3:5$","En":"$12:20=3:5$"}},"TrackIds":[7],"CategoryId":7,"PrimarySkillId":30,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل نسبة الأرز إلى الماء.","En":"Use the rice-to-water ratio."},{"Ar":"حدد عامل تكبير كمية الأرز ثم طبقه على الماء.","En":"Find the scaling factor for rice and apply it to water."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"كميتا الوصفة تتناسبان طردياً.","En":"Recipe quantities are directly proportional."},"Unit":{"Ar":"أكواب","En":"cups"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عامل التكبير من 3 إلى 12 هو 4.","En":"The scale factor from 3 to 12 is 4."},{"Ar":"نضرب كمية الماء في العامل نفسه: 5×4=20.","En":"Multiply the water quantity by the same factor: 5×4=20."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$20$","En":"$20$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضف فرق الكميتين بدلاً من استخدام النسبة.","En":"Do not add the difference instead of scaling."},"FormulaLatex":"W=R\\frac53","Substitution":{"Ar":"$12/3=4,\\quad4\\times5=20$","En":"$12/3=4,\\quad4\\times5=20$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$12:20=3:5$","En":"$12:20=3:5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"15 يمثل ثلاث وصفات، أي 9 أكواب أرز.","En":"15 corresponds to three batches and 9 cups of rice."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18 لا يحافظ على النسبة 3:5.","En":"18 does not preserve ratio 3:5."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"24 يضاعف الأرز دون استخدام نسبة الماء الصحيحة.","En":"24 doubles the rice amount rather than applying the water ratio."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$كميتا الوصفة تتناسبان طردياً.

$W=R\frac53$

1. عامل التكبير من 3 إلى 12 هو 4.

2. نضرب كمية الماء في العامل نفسه: 5×4=20.

$12/3=4,\quad4\times5=20$

$20$ أكواب

$12:20=3:5$

لا تضف فرق الكميتين بدلاً من استخدام النسبة.$mw$,$mw$Recipe quantities are directly proportional.

$W=R\frac53$

1. The scale factor from 3 to 12 is 4.

2. Multiply the water quantity by the same factor: 5×4=20.

$12/3=4,\quad4\times5=20$

$20$ cups

$12:20=3:5$

Do not add the difference instead of scaling.$mw$),
(681,633,$mw$84640002DA315528AA515C1309057E1CB0ABAFDFEDC2A6A81E636AAD2C0AE958$mw$,$mw$0e65de2a1929a2e1a2278b4d0966faa3$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":633,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام هوية فيثاغورس لإيجاد جيب التمام","TitleEn":"Use the Pythagorean identity to find cosine","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كانت θ زاوية حادة وsin(θ) = 3/5، فما cos(θ)؟","QuestionTextEn":"If θ is an acute angle and sin(θ) = 3/5, what is cos(θ)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"من sin²(θ) + cos²(θ) = 1 نحصل على cos²(θ) = 1 − 9/25 = 16/25. نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن θ حادة: cos(θ) = 4/5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Since sin² θ + cos² θ = 1, cos² θ = 1 − 9/25 = 16/25. The angle is acute, so cos θ = 4/5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2521,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac35","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2522,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac45","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2523,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{16}{25}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2524,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"-\\frac45","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل المتطابقة المثلثية الأساسية.","En":"Use the fundamental trigonometric identity."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع جيب التمام واختر إشارة الجذر حسب نوع الزاوية.","En":"Isolate cosine squared and choose the root's sign using the angle type."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام هوية فيثاغورس لإيجاد جيب التمام","En":"Use the Pythagorean identity to find cosine"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 هو الجيب المعطى.","En":"3/5 is the given sine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac35"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac45"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"16/25 مربع جيب التمام.","En":"16/25 is cosine squared."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{16}{25}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"جيب التمام موجب للزاوية الحادة.","En":"Cosine is positive for an acute angle."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-\\frac45"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كانت θ زاوية حادة وsin(θ) = 3/5، فما cos(θ)؟","En":"If θ is an acute angle and sin(θ) = 3/5, what is cos(θ)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس تعطي مربع جيب التمام، والزاوية الحادة تجعل جيب التمام موجباً.","En":"The Pythagorean identity determines cosine squared, and an acute angle has positive cosine."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعوض $\\sin^2\\theta=9/25$ في الهوية فنحصل على $\\cos^2\\theta=16/25$.","En":"Substitute $\\sin^2\\theta=9/25$ into the identity to get $\\cos^2\\theta=16/25$."},{"Ar":"الزاوية حادة، لذا $\\cos\\theta=+\\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$.","En":"The angle is acute, so $\\cos\\theta=+\\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac45$","En":"$\\frac45$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك مربع جيب التمام أو تختَر الجذر السالب.","En":"Do not leave cosine squared or choose the negative root."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\\sqrt{16/25}=\\frac45$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\\sqrt{16/25}=\\frac45$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$","En":"$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":47,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استعمل المتطابقة المثلثية الأساسية.","En":"Use the fundamental trigonometric identity."},{"Ar":"اعزل مربع جيب التمام واختر إشارة الجذر حسب نوع الزاوية.","En":"Isolate cosine squared and choose the root's sign using the angle type."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس تعطي مربع جيب التمام، والزاوية الحادة تجعل جيب التمام موجباً.","En":"The Pythagorean identity determines cosine squared, and an acute angle has positive cosine."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نعوض $\\sin^2\\theta=9/25$ في الهوية فنحصل على $\\cos^2\\theta=16/25$.","En":"Substitute $\\sin^2\\theta=9/25$ into the identity to get $\\cos^2\\theta=16/25$."},{"Ar":"الزاوية حادة، لذا $\\cos\\theta=+\\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$.","En":"The angle is acute, so $\\cos\\theta=+\\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac45$","En":"$\\frac45$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تترك مربع جيب التمام أو تختَر الجذر السالب.","En":"Do not leave cosine squared or choose the negative root."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\\sqrt{16/25}=\\frac45$","En":"$\\cos\\theta=\\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\\sqrt{16/25}=\\frac45$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$","En":"$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 هو الجيب المعطى.","En":"3/5 is the given sine."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"16/25 مربع جيب التمام.","En":"16/25 is cosine squared."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"جيب التمام موجب للزاوية الحادة.","En":"Cosine is positive for an acute angle."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$متطابقة فيثاغورس تعطي مربع جيب التمام، والزاوية الحادة تجعل جيب التمام موجباً.

$\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$

1. نعوض $\sin^2\theta=9/25$ في الهوية فنحصل على $\cos^2\theta=16/25$.

2. الزاوية حادة، لذا $\cos\theta=+\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$.

$\cos\theta=\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\sqrt{16/25}=\frac45$

$\frac45$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$

لا تترك مربع جيب التمام أو تختَر الجذر السالب.$mw$,$mw$The Pythagorean identity determines cosine squared, and an acute angle has positive cosine.

$\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$

1. Substitute $\sin^2\theta=9/25$ into the identity to get $\cos^2\theta=16/25$.

2. The angle is acute, so $\cos\theta=+\sqrt{16/25}=4/5$.

$\cos\theta=\sqrt{1-(3/5)^2}=\sqrt{16/25}=\frac45$

$\frac45$ Dimensionless

$(3/5)^2+(4/5)^2=1$

Do not leave cosine squared or choose the negative root.$mw$),
(682,634,$mw$3B4DEDEA81C82B7C8CFABB4B8457770E73FA6646A21CF8D4C452E10F75D7FAB8$mw$,$mw$b5a796753c71bb019e3ce01432d90a46$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":634,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استنتاج الجيب من جيب التمام","TitleEn":"Find sine from cosine","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كانت θ حادة وcos(θ) = 5/13، فكم sin(θ)؟","QuestionTextEn":"If θ is acute and cos(θ) = 5/13, find sin(θ).","DetailedSolutionAr":"sin²(θ) = 1 − 25/169 = 144/169، وبما أن الزاوية حادة فـ sin(θ) = 12/13.","DetailedSolutionEn":"sin² θ = 1 − 25/169 = 144/169. Because θ is acute, sin θ = 12/13.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2525,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac5{13}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2526,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac{12}{13}","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2527,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac{144}{169}","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2528,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{13}{12}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم العلاقة بين مربعي الجيب وجيب التمام.","En":"Use the identity connecting squared sine and cosine."},{"Ar":"اطرح مربع جيب التمام من الواحد واختر الجذر الموافق للزاوية الحادة.","En":"Subtract cosine squared from one and choose the root for an acute angle."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استنتاج الجيب من جيب التمام","En":"Find sine from cosine"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5/13 هو جيب التمام المعطى.","En":"5/13 is the given cosine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac5{13}"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac{12}{13}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"144/169 مربع الجيب لا الجيب.","En":"144/169 is sine squared, not sine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{144}{169}"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"13/12 أكبر من 1 فلا يصلح قيمة للجيب.","En":"13/12 exceeds 1 and cannot be a sine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{13}{12}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كانت θ حادة وcos(θ) = 5/13، فكم sin(θ)؟","En":"If θ is acute and cos(θ) = 5/13, find sin(θ)."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس المثلثية: $\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1$. نأخذ الجذر الموجب في الزاوية الحادة.","En":"Pythagorean trigonometric identity: $\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1$. Take the positive root for an acute angle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\sin^2\\theta=1-25/169=144/169$.","En":"$\\sin^2\\theta=1-25/169=144/169$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن الزاوية حادة: $\\sin\\theta=12/13$.","En":"Take the positive square root because the angle is acute: $\\sin\\theta=12/13$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12/13$","En":"$12/13$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تتوقف عند مربع الجيب.","En":"Do not stop at sine squared."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1-25/169=144/169$","En":"$1-25/169=144/169$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$","En":"$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":47,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"استخدم العلاقة بين مربعي الجيب وجيب التمام.","En":"Use the identity connecting squared sine and cosine."},{"Ar":"اطرح مربع جيب التمام من الواحد واختر الجذر الموافق للزاوية الحادة.","En":"Subtract cosine squared from one and choose the root for an acute angle."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس المثلثية: $\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1$. نأخذ الجذر الموجب في الزاوية الحادة.","En":"Pythagorean trigonometric identity: $\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1$. Take the positive root for an acute angle."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\sin^2\\theta=1-25/169=144/169$.","En":"$\\sin^2\\theta=1-25/169=144/169$."},{"Ar":"نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن الزاوية حادة: $\\sin\\theta=12/13$.","En":"Take the positive square root because the angle is acute: $\\sin\\theta=12/13$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$12/13$","En":"$12/13$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تتوقف عند مربع الجيب.","En":"Do not stop at sine squared."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sin^2\\theta+\\cos^2\\theta=1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1-25/169=144/169$","En":"$1-25/169=144/169$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$","En":"$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5/13 هو جيب التمام المعطى.","En":"5/13 is the given cosine."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"144/169 مربع الجيب لا الجيب.","En":"144/169 is sine squared, not sine."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"13/12 أكبر من 1 فلا يصلح قيمة للجيب.","En":"13/12 exceeds 1 and cannot be a sine."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$متطابقة فيثاغورس المثلثية: $\sin^2\theta+\cos^2\theta=1$. نأخذ الجذر الموجب في الزاوية الحادة.

$\sin^2\theta+\cos^2\theta=1$

1. $\sin^2\theta=1-25/169=144/169$.

2. نأخذ الجذر الموجب لأن الزاوية حادة: $\sin\theta=12/13$.

$1-25/169=144/169$

$12/13$ بلا وحدة قياس

$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$

لا تتوقف عند مربع الجيب.$mw$,$mw$Pythagorean trigonometric identity: $\sin^2\theta+\cos^2\theta=1$. Take the positive root for an acute angle.

$\sin^2\theta+\cos^2\theta=1$

1. $\sin^2\theta=1-25/169=144/169$.

2. Take the positive square root because the angle is acute: $\sin\theta=12/13$.

$1-25/169=144/169$

$12/13$ Dimensionless

$(12/13)^2+(5/13)^2=1$

Do not stop at sine squared.$mw$),
(683,635,$mw$8F09D14B3F841C3596DED6D55104F301ECEFD29D2359F4D503021C51D025D5ED$mw$,$mw$e07dfead367cde0c27e67761730f10d6$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":635,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ربط الظل بمثلث قائم وهوية فيثاغورس","TitleEn":"Recover sine from tangent via a right triangle","QuestionTextAr":"زاوية حادة θ تحقق tan(θ) = 3/4. ما قيمة sin(θ)؟","QuestionTextEn":"For an acute angle θ, tan(θ) = 3/4. What is sin(θ)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"نعد الضلع المقابل 3 والمجاور 4، فيكون الوتر 5 بفيثاغورس. إذن sin(θ) = 3/5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Use opposite side 3 and adjacent side 4. The hypotenuse is 5, so sin θ = 3/5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2529,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac34","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2530,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"\\frac35","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2531,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac45","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2532,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac53","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"مثّل الظل بنسبة المقابل إلى المجاور في مثلث قائم.","En":"Represent tangent as opposite over adjacent in a right triangle."},{"Ar":"أوجد الوتر بفيثاغورس ثم كوّن نسبة المقابل إلى الوتر.","En":"Find the hypotenuse using Pythagoras, then form opposite over hypotenuse."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ربط الظل بمثلث قائم وهوية فيثاغورس","En":"Recover sine from tangent via a right triangle"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"3/4 هو الظل المعطى.","En":"3/4 is the given tangent."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac34"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac35"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4/5 هو جيب التمام.","En":"4/5 is cosine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac45"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"5/3 مقلوب الجيب وأكبر من 1.","En":"5/3 is reciprocal sine and exceeds 1."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac53"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"زاوية حادة θ تحقق tan(θ) = 3/4. ما قيمة sin(θ)؟","En":"For an acute angle θ, tan(θ) = 3/4. What is sin(θ)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تعريف النسب المثلثية: $\\tan\\theta=o/a$ و$\\sin\\theta=o/h$، والوتر $h=\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$.","En":"Trigonometric ratios: $\\tan\\theta=o/a$ and $\\sin\\theta=o/h$, with hypotenuse $h=\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نختار مثلثاً قائماً له ضلع مقابل 3 ومجاور 4؛ الوتر $\\sqrt{9+16}=5$.","En":"Choose a right triangle with opposite leg 3 and adjacent leg 4; the hypotenuse is $\\sqrt{9+16}=5$."},{"Ar":"الجيب هو المقابل على الوتر: $\\sin\\theta=3/5$.","En":"Sine is opposite over hypotenuse: $\\sin\\theta=3/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3/5$","En":"$3/5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجيب مقابل على وتر وليس مقابل على مجاور.","En":"Sine is opposite over hypotenuse, not adjacent."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{o}{a},\\quad\\sin\\theta=\\frac{o}{\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$h=\\sqrt{9+16}=5$","En":"$h=\\sqrt{9+16}=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$","En":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":47,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"مثّل الظل بنسبة المقابل إلى المجاور في مثلث قائم.","En":"Represent tangent as opposite over adjacent in a right triangle."},{"Ar":"أوجد الوتر بفيثاغورس ثم كوّن نسبة المقابل إلى الوتر.","En":"Find the hypotenuse using Pythagoras, then form opposite over hypotenuse."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تعريف النسب المثلثية: $\\tan\\theta=o/a$ و$\\sin\\theta=o/h$، والوتر $h=\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$.","En":"Trigonometric ratios: $\\tan\\theta=o/a$ and $\\sin\\theta=o/h$, with hypotenuse $h=\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نختار مثلثاً قائماً له ضلع مقابل 3 ومجاور 4؛ الوتر $\\sqrt{9+16}=5$.","En":"Choose a right triangle with opposite leg 3 and adjacent leg 4; the hypotenuse is $\\sqrt{9+16}=5$."},{"Ar":"الجيب هو المقابل على الوتر: $\\sin\\theta=3/5$.","En":"Sine is opposite over hypotenuse: $\\sin\\theta=3/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3/5$","En":"$3/5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"الجيب مقابل على وتر وليس مقابل على مجاور.","En":"Sine is opposite over hypotenuse, not adjacent."},"FormulaLatex":"\\tan\\theta=\\frac{o}{a},\\quad\\sin\\theta=\\frac{o}{\\sqrt{o^2+a^2}}","Substitution":{"Ar":"$h=\\sqrt{9+16}=5$","En":"$h=\\sqrt{9+16}=5$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$","En":"$3^2+4^2=5^2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3/4 هو الظل المعطى.","En":"3/4 is the given tangent."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4/5 هو جيب التمام.","En":"4/5 is cosine."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5/3 مقلوب الجيب وأكبر من 1.","En":"5/3 is reciprocal sine and exceeds 1."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تعريف النسب المثلثية: $\tan\theta=o/a$ و$\sin\theta=o/h$، والوتر $h=\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{o}{a},\quad\sin\theta=\frac{o}{\sqrt{o^2+a^2}}$

1. نختار مثلثاً قائماً له ضلع مقابل 3 ومجاور 4؛ الوتر $\sqrt{9+16}=5$.

2. الجيب هو المقابل على الوتر: $\sin\theta=3/5$.

$h=\sqrt{9+16}=5$

$3/5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3^2+4^2=5^2$

الجيب مقابل على وتر وليس مقابل على مجاور.$mw$,$mw$Trigonometric ratios: $\tan\theta=o/a$ and $\sin\theta=o/h$, with hypotenuse $h=\sqrt{o^2+a^2}$.

$\tan\theta=\frac{o}{a},\quad\sin\theta=\frac{o}{\sqrt{o^2+a^2}}$

1. Choose a right triangle with opposite leg 3 and adjacent leg 4; the hypotenuse is $\sqrt{9+16}=5$.

2. Sine is opposite over hypotenuse: $\sin\theta=3/5$.

$h=\sqrt{9+16}=5$

$3/5$ Dimensionless

$3^2+4^2=5^2$

Sine is opposite over hypotenuse, not adjacent.$mw$),
(684,636,$mw$6856642538FA73BFC9463100C44C43B599DE2668A77501AEA144A96E7AE2B475$mw$,$mw$83f82e004be80d4314240d6f2de3e190$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":636,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":10,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تحديد إشارة جيب التمام في الربع الثاني","TitleEn":"Determine cosine sign in quadrant II","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كانت θ في الربع الثاني وsin(θ) = 4/5، فما cos(θ)؟","QuestionTextEn":"θ lies in quadrant II and sin(θ) = 4/5. What is cos(θ)?","DetailedSolutionAr":"cos²(θ) = 1 − 16/25 = 9/25. جيب التمام سالب في الربع الثاني، إذن −3/5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"cos² θ = 9/25. Cosine is negative in quadrant II, so cos θ = −3/5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2533,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac35","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2534,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-\\frac35","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2535,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"\\frac45","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2536,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"-\\frac45","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مقدار جيب التمام باستخدام المتطابقة المثلثية.","En":"Find the cosine magnitude using the trigonometric identity."},{"Ar":"بعد استخراج الجذر حدّد إشارته من الربع الثاني.","En":"After taking the square root, choose its sign using quadrant II."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تحديد إشارة جيب التمام في الربع الثاني","En":"Determine cosine sign in quadrant II"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 له المقدار الصحيح لكن الإشارة خاطئة.","En":"3/5 has the correct magnitude but wrong sign."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac35"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-\\frac35"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4/5 هو الجيب المعطى.","En":"4/5 is the given sine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac45"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"−4/5 لا يحقق الهوية مع الجيب المعطى.","En":"−4/5 fails the identity with the given sine."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-\\frac45"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كانت θ في الربع الثاني وsin(θ) = 4/5، فما cos(θ)؟","En":"θ lies in quadrant II and sin(θ) = 4/5. What is cos(θ)?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس: $\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta$؛ تحدد إشارة الجذر من الربع.","En":"Pythagorean identity: $\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta$; the quadrant determines the root sign."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\cos^2\\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$.","En":"$\\cos^2\\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$."},{"Ar":"في الربع الثاني جيب التمام سالب، فنختار $\\cos\\theta=-3/5$.","En":"Cosine is negative in quadrant II, so choose $\\cos\\theta=-3/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3/5$","En":"$-3/5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الربع المحدد.","En":"Do not ignore the quadrant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1-16/25=9/25$","En":"$1-16/25=9/25$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$9/25+16/25=1$ والإشارة سالبة.","En":"$9/25+16/25=1$ and the sign is negative."}},"TrackIds":[12],"CategoryId":10,"PrimarySkillId":47,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب مقدار جيب التمام باستخدام المتطابقة المثلثية.","En":"Find the cosine magnitude using the trigonometric identity."},{"Ar":"بعد استخراج الجذر حدّد إشارته من الربع الثاني.","En":"After taking the square root, choose its sign using quadrant II."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"متطابقة فيثاغورس: $\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta$؛ تحدد إشارة الجذر من الربع.","En":"Pythagorean identity: $\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta$; the quadrant determines the root sign."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"$\\cos^2\\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$.","En":"$\\cos^2\\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$."},{"Ar":"في الربع الثاني جيب التمام سالب، فنختار $\\cos\\theta=-3/5$.","En":"Cosine is negative in quadrant II, so choose $\\cos\\theta=-3/5$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3/5$","En":"$-3/5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل الربع المحدد.","En":"Do not ignore the quadrant."},"FormulaLatex":"\\cos^2\\theta=1-\\sin^2\\theta","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1-16/25=9/25$","En":"$1-16/25=9/25$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$9/25+16/25=1$ والإشارة سالبة.","En":"$9/25+16/25=1$ and the sign is negative."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3/5 له المقدار الصحيح لكن الإشارة خاطئة.","En":"3/5 has the correct magnitude but wrong sign."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4/5 هو الجيب المعطى.","En":"4/5 is the given sine."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"−4/5 لا يحقق الهوية مع الجيب المعطى.","En":"−4/5 fails the identity with the given sine."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$متطابقة فيثاغورس: $\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$؛ تحدد إشارة الجذر من الربع.

$\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$

1. $\cos^2\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$.

2. في الربع الثاني جيب التمام سالب، فنختار $\cos\theta=-3/5$.

$1-16/25=9/25$

$-3/5$ بلا وحدة قياس

$9/25+16/25=1$ والإشارة سالبة.

لا تهمل الربع المحدد.$mw$,$mw$Pythagorean identity: $\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$; the quadrant determines the root sign.

$\cos^2\theta=1-\sin^2\theta$

1. $\cos^2\theta=1-(4/5)^2=9/25$.

2. Cosine is negative in quadrant II, so choose $\cos\theta=-3/5$.

$1-16/25=9/25$

$-3/5$ Dimensionless

$9/25+16/25=1$ and the sign is negative.

Do not ignore the quadrant.$mw$),
(685,637,$mw$C1456CE3FDA0610B793B9BABC17575CB86324D30F7D813A213358222EF4F8711$mw$,$mw$c5fa7d87f4e013f42ec4019402685953$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":637,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تقييم لوغاريتم عدد أصغر من الواحد","TitleEn":"Evaluate a logarithm of a reciprocal power","QuestionTextAr":"أوجد قيمة log₅(1/125).","QuestionTextEn":"Evaluate log base 5 of 1/125.","DetailedSolutionAr":"تعريف اللوغاريتم: logₐ(ب) = ج يعني أن أ^ج = ب. بما أن 125 = 5³، فإن 1/125 = 5^(−3). إذن log₅(1/125) = −3 لأن رفع 5 للأس السالب الثالث يعطينا مقلوب 125. التحقق بإعادة الأس: 5^(−3) = 1/125.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Logarithm definition: log_a(b)=c means a^c=b. Since 125=5³, we have 1/125=5^(−3). Thus log₅(1/125)=−3, because the negative exponent gives a reciprocal. Check by exponentiation: 5^(−3)=1/125.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2537,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"-5","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2538,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"-3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2539,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2540,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل العدد إلى قوة للأساس 5.","En":"Express the argument as a power of 5."},{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة الأس السالب للمقلوب.","En":"Use the negative-exponent rule for reciprocals."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تقييم لوغاريتم عدد أصغر من الواحد","En":"Evaluate a logarithm of a reciprocal power"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"5 مرفوعاً للأس −5 يعطي 1/3125.","En":"5 to power −5 gives 1/3125."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-5"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"-3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأس 3 يعطي 125 لا مقلوبه.","En":"Power 3 gives 125 rather than its reciprocal."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأس 5 يعطي 3125.","En":"Power 5 gives 3125."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"5"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"أوجد قيمة log₅(1/125).","En":"Evaluate log base 5 of 1/125."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة الموجبة.","En":"A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of a positive power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نكتب $125=5^3$ ومنه $1/125=5^{-3}$.","En":"Write $125=5^3$, so $1/125=5^{-3}$."},{"Ar":"$\\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ لأن الأساس موجب وغير الواحد.","En":"$\\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ because the base is positive and not one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل إشارة الأس السالب.","En":"Do not omit the negative exponent sign."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b(b^n)=n,\\quad b>0,\\ b\\ne1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1/125=5^{-3}\\Rightarrow\\log_5(1/125)=-3$","En":"$1/125=5^{-3}\\Rightarrow\\log_5(1/125)=-3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^{-3}=1/125$","En":"$5^{-3}=1/125$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":42,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل العدد إلى قوة للأساس 5.","En":"Express the argument as a power of 5."},{"Ar":"استعمل قاعدة الأس السالب للمقلوب.","En":"Use the negative-exponent rule for reciprocals."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة الموجبة.","En":"A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of a positive power."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نكتب $125=5^3$ ومنه $1/125=5^{-3}$.","En":"Write $125=5^3$, so $1/125=5^{-3}$."},{"Ar":"$\\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ لأن الأساس موجب وغير الواحد.","En":"$\\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ because the base is positive and not one."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$-3$","En":"$-3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تهمل إشارة الأس السالب.","En":"Do not omit the negative exponent sign."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b(b^n)=n,\\quad b>0,\\ b\\ne1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$1/125=5^{-3}\\Rightarrow\\log_5(1/125)=-3$","En":"$1/125=5^{-3}\\Rightarrow\\log_5(1/125)=-3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$5^{-3}=1/125$","En":"$5^{-3}=1/125$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"5 مرفوعاً للأس −5 يعطي 1/3125.","En":"5 to power −5 gives 1/3125."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الأس 3 يعطي 125 لا مقلوبه.","En":"Power 3 gives 125 rather than its reciprocal."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الأس 5 يعطي 3125.","En":"Power 5 gives 3125."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$الأس السالب يعطي مقلوب القوة الموجبة.

$\log_b(b^n)=n,\quad b>0,\ b\ne1$

1. نكتب $125=5^3$ ومنه $1/125=5^{-3}$.

2. $\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ لأن الأساس موجب وغير الواحد.

$1/125=5^{-3}\Rightarrow\log_5(1/125)=-3$

$-3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$5^{-3}=1/125$

لا تهمل إشارة الأس السالب.$mw$,$mw$A negative exponent gives the reciprocal of a positive power.

$\log_b(b^n)=n,\quad b>0,\ b\ne1$

1. Write $125=5^3$, so $1/125=5^{-3}$.

2. $\log_5(5^{-3})=-3$ because the base is positive and not one.

$1/125=5^{-3}\Rightarrow\log_5(1/125)=-3$

$-3$ Dimensionless

$5^{-3}=1/125$

Do not omit the negative exponent sign.$mw$),
(686,638,$mw$A2E9FEF7C58ED7A18A9A6AA15B66C054E0D2E717CE6B6150CCFA41D4A240C32B$mw$,$mw$139524b19fdd378e1b151c6d1980ca94$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":638,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"ربط لوغاريتم الجذر بالأس الكسري","TitleEn":"Interpret a logarithm as a fractional exponent","QuestionTextAr":"ما قيمة log₄(2)؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is log base 4 of 2?","DetailedSolutionAr":"نبحث عن العدد x الذي يحقق 4^x = 2؛ وبما أن الجذر التربيعي لـ4 يساوي 2، فإن x = 1/2.","DetailedSolutionEn":"We seek x with 4^x = 2. Since the square root of 4 is 2, x = 1/2.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2541,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac12","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2542,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2543,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"-\\frac12","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2544,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل اللوغاريتم إلى معادلة أسية.","En":"Rewrite the logarithm as an exponential equation."},{"Ar":"اسأل: لأي أس تكون القوة ذات الأساس أربعة مساوية للعدد اثنين؟","En":"Ask which exponent on base four gives two."}],"Title":{"Ar":"ربط لوغاريتم الجذر بالأس الكسري","En":"Interpret a logarithm as a fractional exponent"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac12"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4²=16 وليس 2.","En":"4²=16, not 2."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي 1/2.","En":"The negative exponent gives 1/2."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"-\\frac12"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4⁴=256 لا 2.","En":"4⁴=256, not 2."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما قيمة log₄(2)؟","En":"What is log base 4 of 2?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تعريف اللوغاريتم: $\\log_b a=x$ إذا وفقط إذا $b^x=a$، حيث $a>0$ و$b>0$ و$b\\ne1$.","En":"Logarithm definition: $\\log_b a=x$ exactly when $b^x=a$, for $a>0$, $b>0$, $b\\ne1$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نبحث عن أس $x$ يحقق $4^x=2$.","En":"Find an exponent $x$ satisfying $4^x=2$."},{"Ar":"بما أن $4^{1/2}=\\sqrt4=2$، فالأس هو $1/2$.","En":"Since $4^{1/2}=\\sqrt4=2$, the exponent is $1/2$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x=1/2$","En":"$x=1/2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل الأساس والعدد المطلوب لوغاريتمه.","En":"Do not interchange the base and argument."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b a=x\\iff b^x=a","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4^x=2$","En":"$4^x=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4^{1/2}=2$","En":"$4^{1/2}=2$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":42,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل اللوغاريتم إلى معادلة أسية.","En":"Rewrite the logarithm as an exponential equation."},{"Ar":"اسأل: لأي أس تكون القوة ذات الأساس أربعة مساوية للعدد اثنين؟","En":"Ask which exponent on base four gives two."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"تعريف اللوغاريتم: $\\log_b a=x$ إذا وفقط إذا $b^x=a$، حيث $a>0$ و$b>0$ و$b\\ne1$.","En":"Logarithm definition: $\\log_b a=x$ exactly when $b^x=a$, for $a>0$, $b>0$, $b\\ne1$."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"نبحث عن أس $x$ يحقق $4^x=2$.","En":"Find an exponent $x$ satisfying $4^x=2$."},{"Ar":"بما أن $4^{1/2}=\\sqrt4=2$، فالأس هو $1/2$.","En":"Since $4^{1/2}=\\sqrt4=2$, the exponent is $1/2$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$x=1/2$","En":"$x=1/2$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تبدّل الأساس والعدد المطلوب لوغاريتمه.","En":"Do not interchange the base and argument."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b a=x\\iff b^x=a","Substitution":{"Ar":"$4^x=2$","En":"$4^x=2$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$4^{1/2}=2$","En":"$4^{1/2}=2$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4²=16 وليس 2.","En":"4²=16, not 2."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"الأس السالب يعطي 1/2.","En":"The negative exponent gives 1/2."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4⁴=256 لا 2.","En":"4⁴=256, not 2."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$تعريف اللوغاريتم: $\log_b a=x$ إذا وفقط إذا $b^x=a$، حيث $a>0$ و$b>0$ و$b\ne1$.

$\log_b a=x\iff b^x=a$

1. نبحث عن أس $x$ يحقق $4^x=2$.

2. بما أن $4^{1/2}=\sqrt4=2$، فالأس هو $1/2$.

$4^x=2$

$x=1/2$ بلا وحدة قياس

$4^{1/2}=2$

لا تبدّل الأساس والعدد المطلوب لوغاريتمه.$mw$,$mw$Logarithm definition: $\log_b a=x$ exactly when $b^x=a$, for $a>0$, $b>0$, $b\ne1$.

$\log_b a=x\iff b^x=a$

1. Find an exponent $x$ satisfying $4^x=2$.

2. Since $4^{1/2}=\sqrt4=2$, the exponent is $1/2$.

$4^x=2$

$x=1/2$ Dimensionless

$4^{1/2}=2$

Do not interchange the base and argument.$mw$),
(687,639,$mw$87881B38689FB9A2ED28137C27AA502D3962E7E634742E4B5D9E94C4F42F9E9A$mw$,$mw$03a02e756cf5b28bb32aa1708bd1477d$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":639,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"استخدام خاصية طرح اللوغاريتمات","TitleEn":"Evaluate a difference of logarithms","QuestionTextAr":"احسب log₃(81) − log₃(3).","QuestionTextEn":"Calculate log base 3 of 81 minus log base 3 of 3.","DetailedSolutionAr":"لأن 81 = 3⁴ و3 = 3¹، فإن الفرق 4 − 1 = 3. ويمكن أيضاً استخدام log₃(81/3) = log₃(27).","DetailedSolutionEn":"Since 81 = 3^4 and 3 = 3^1, the difference is 4 − 1 = 3. Equivalently log₃(81/3) = log₃(27).","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2545,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"1","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2546,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2547,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2548,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ أن الأساس واحد في اللوغاريتمين.","En":"Notice the common base."},{"Ar":"استخدم قاعدة خارج القسمة ثم اكتب الناتج على صورة قوة للأساس.","En":"Use the quotient rule, then write the argument as a power of the base."}],"Title":{"Ar":"استخدام خاصية طرح اللوغاريتمات","En":"Evaluate a difference of logarithms"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"1 هو لوغاريتم 3 فقط.","En":"1 is the logarithm of 3 alone."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"1"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"2 هو لوغاريتم 9 لا 27.","En":"2 is the logarithm of 9, not 27."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 هو لوغاريتم 81 قبل الطرح.","En":"4 is the logarithm of 81 before subtraction."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب log₃(81) − log₃(3).","En":"Calculate log base 3 of 81 minus log base 3 of 3."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح لوغاريتمين للأساس نفسه يحوّل إلى لوغاريتم خارج القسمة.","En":"Subtracting logs of the same base gives the log of their quotient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العددان 81 و3 موجبان والأساس 3 صالح؛ نستخدم قانون خارج القسمة.","En":"Both 81 and 3 are positive and base 3 is valid; use the quotient law."},{"Ar":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3(27)=3$.","En":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3(27)=3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح العددين داخل اللوغاريتم مباشرة.","En":"Do not subtract the arguments directly."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b u-\\log_b v=\\log_b(u/v),\\quad u,v>0,\\ b>0,\\ b\\ne1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3 27=3$","En":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3 27=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^3=27$","En":"$3^3=27$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":42,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"لاحظ أن الأساس واحد في اللوغاريتمين.","En":"Notice the common base."},{"Ar":"استخدم قاعدة خارج القسمة ثم اكتب الناتج على صورة قوة للأساس.","En":"Use the quotient rule, then write the argument as a power of the base."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"طرح لوغاريتمين للأساس نفسه يحوّل إلى لوغاريتم خارج القسمة.","En":"Subtracting logs of the same base gives the log of their quotient."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"العددان 81 و3 موجبان والأساس 3 صالح؛ نستخدم قانون خارج القسمة.","En":"Both 81 and 3 are positive and base 3 is valid; use the quotient law."},{"Ar":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3(27)=3$.","En":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3(27)=3$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$3$","En":"$3$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تطرح العددين داخل اللوغاريتم مباشرة.","En":"Do not subtract the arguments directly."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b u-\\log_b v=\\log_b(u/v),\\quad u,v>0,\\ b>0,\\ b\\ne1","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3 27=3$","En":"$\\log_3(81/3)=\\log_3 27=3$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3^3=27$","En":"$3^3=27$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 هو لوغاريتم 3 فقط.","En":"1 is the logarithm of 3 alone."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 هو لوغاريتم 9 لا 27.","En":"2 is the logarithm of 9, not 27."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 هو لوغاريتم 81 قبل الطرح.","En":"4 is the logarithm of 81 before subtraction."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$طرح لوغاريتمين للأساس نفسه يحوّل إلى لوغاريتم خارج القسمة.

$\log_b u-\log_b v=\log_b(u/v),\quad u,v>0,\ b>0,\ b\ne1$

1. العددان 81 و3 موجبان والأساس 3 صالح؛ نستخدم قانون خارج القسمة.

2. $\log_3(81/3)=\log_3(27)=3$.

$\log_3(81/3)=\log_3 27=3$

$3$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3^3=27$

لا تطرح العددين داخل اللوغاريتم مباشرة.$mw$,$mw$Subtracting logs of the same base gives the log of their quotient.

$\log_b u-\log_b v=\log_b(u/v),\quad u,v>0,\ b>0,\ b\ne1$

1. Both 81 and 3 are positive and base 3 is valid; use the quotient law.

2. $\log_3(81/3)=\log_3(27)=3$.

$\log_3(81/3)=\log_3 27=3$

$3$ Dimensionless

$3^3=27$

Do not subtract the arguments directly.$mw$),
(688,640,$mw$2F788396781BA36068BE72C201D2EDEE81CE6471DA8DADE2D7A3F30B95C7C216$mw$,$mw$f0e716deaacfa848b116fe4fee202b9c$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":640,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":9,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"تحويل معادلة لوغاريتمية إلى أسية","TitleEn":"Convert logarithmic notation to exponential form","QuestionTextAr":"إذا كان log₂(x) = 5، فما قيمة x؟","QuestionTextEn":"If log base 2 of x equals 5, what is x?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المبدأ المستخدم: اللوغاريتم والقوة عمليتان عكسيتان. من log₂(س) = 5 نعيد الكتابة على صورة أسية: 2⁵ = س. بالتعويض: س = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32، وهو عدد موجب كما يقتضي مجال اللوغاريتم. التحقق: log₂32 = 5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Rule used: Logarithms invert exponentiation. Rewrite log₂(x) = 5 in exponential form: 2⁵ = x. Evaluate x = 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 × 2 = 32. The value is positive as required by the logarithm's domain. Check: log₂32 = 5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2549,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"7","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2550,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"10","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2551,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"25","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2552,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"32","IsCorrect":true}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل المعادلة اللوغاريتمية إلى أسية.","En":"Rewrite the logarithmic equation in exponential form."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأساس إلى الأس المعطى في الطرف الآخر.","En":"Raise the base to the exponent given on the other side."}],"Title":{"Ar":"تحويل معادلة لوغاريتمية إلى أسية","En":"Convert logarithmic notation to exponential form"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"7 يجمع الأساس والأس بدلاً من رفعه للأس.","En":"7 adds base and exponent instead of exponentiating."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"7"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"10 يضرب الأساس في الأس.","En":"10 multiplies the base and exponent."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"10"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"25 يربع الأس بدلاً من رفع 2 للقوة 5.","En":"25 squares the exponent rather than raising 2 to power 5."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"25"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"32"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"إذا كان log₂(x) = 5، فما قيمة x؟","En":"If log base 2 of x equals 5, what is x?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التعريف الأسي للوغاريتم يحول المعادلة إلى قوة للأساس.","En":"The exponential definition of logarithms rewrites the equation as a power of the base."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"شرط اللوغاريتم $x>0$؛ نعيد كتابة المعادلة $x=2^5$.","En":"The logarithm requires $x>0$; rewrite the equation as $x=2^5$."},{"Ar":"نضرب خمسة عوامل من 2: $2^5=32$.","En":"Multiply five factors of 2: $2^5=32$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$32$","En":"$32$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب الأساس بالأس.","En":"Do not multiply the base by the exponent."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b x=y\\iff x=b^y,\\quad b>0,\\ b\\ne1,\\ x>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\log_2 x=5\\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$","En":"$\\log_2 x=5\\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\log_2 32=5$","En":"$\\log_2 32=5$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":9,"PrimarySkillId":42,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"حوّل المعادلة اللوغاريتمية إلى أسية.","En":"Rewrite the logarithmic equation in exponential form."},{"Ar":"ارفع الأساس إلى الأس المعطى في الطرف الآخر.","En":"Raise the base to the exponent given on the other side."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التعريف الأسي للوغاريتم يحول المعادلة إلى قوة للأساس.","En":"The exponential definition of logarithms rewrites the equation as a power of the base."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"شرط اللوغاريتم $x>0$؛ نعيد كتابة المعادلة $x=2^5$.","En":"The logarithm requires $x>0$; rewrite the equation as $x=2^5$."},{"Ar":"نضرب خمسة عوامل من 2: $2^5=32$.","En":"Multiply five factors of 2: $2^5=32$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$32$","En":"$32$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب الأساس بالأس.","En":"Do not multiply the base by the exponent."},"FormulaLatex":"\\log_b x=y\\iff x=b^y,\\quad b>0,\\ b\\ne1,\\ x>0","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\log_2 x=5\\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$","En":"$\\log_2 x=5\\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\log_2 32=5$","En":"$\\log_2 32=5$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7 يجمع الأساس والأس بدلاً من رفعه للأس.","En":"7 adds base and exponent instead of exponentiating."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"10 يضرب الأساس في الأس.","En":"10 multiplies the base and exponent."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"25 يربع الأس بدلاً من رفع 2 للقوة 5.","En":"25 squares the exponent rather than raising 2 to power 5."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التعريف الأسي للوغاريتم يحول المعادلة إلى قوة للأساس.

$\log_b x=y\iff x=b^y,\quad b>0,\ b\ne1,\ x>0$

1. شرط اللوغاريتم $x>0$؛ نعيد كتابة المعادلة $x=2^5$.

2. نضرب خمسة عوامل من 2: $2^5=32$.

$\log_2 x=5\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$

$32$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\log_2 32=5$

لا تضرب الأساس بالأس.$mw$,$mw$The exponential definition of logarithms rewrites the equation as a power of the base.

$\log_b x=y\iff x=b^y,\quad b>0,\ b\ne1,\ x>0$

1. The logarithm requires $x>0$; rewrite the equation as $x=2^5$.

2. Multiply five factors of 2: $2^5=32$.

$\log_2 x=5\Rightarrow x=2^5=32$

$32$ Dimensionless

$\log_2 32=5$

Do not multiply the base by the exponent.$mw$),
(689,641,$mw$71D7C9823FFA2FF90C2BB9752E363B01A49817AB08164ABA158B36609768315B$mw$,$mw$7dac33eb2f91c3916ca43517d92beca4$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":641,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":35,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب تباين مجتمع مكوّن من ثلاث قيم","TitleEn":"Calculate population variance for three values","QuestionTextAr":"ما تباين المجتمع للقيم 1، 3، 5؟","QuestionTextEn":"What is the population variance of the values 1, 3, 5?","DetailedSolutionAr":"المتوسط 3، ومجموع مربعات الفروق (−2)² + 0² + 2² = 8. نقسم على حجم المجتمع 3 فنحصل على 8/3.","DetailedSolutionEn":"The mean is 3. Squared deviations add to 4 + 0 + 4 = 8; divide by population size 3 to get 8/3.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2553,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"\\frac83","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2554,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2555,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"8","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2556,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{6}","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المتوسط الحسابي أولاً.","En":"Calculate the mean first."},{"Ar":"ربّع الانحرافات واجمعها ثم اقسم على عدد المشاهدات.","En":"Square the deviations, sum, and divide by the population size."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب تباين مجتمع مكوّن من ثلاث قيم","En":"Calculate population variance for three values"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"\\frac83"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 ينتج من القسمة على 2 وفق تباين العينة لا المجتمع.","En":"4 divides by 2 as in sample rather than population variance."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"8 مجموع المربعات دون قسمة.","En":"8 is the squared-deviation sum without averaging."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"8"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"8/6 يقسم على ضعف عدد القيم.","En":"8/6 divides by twice the population size."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"\\frac{8}{6}"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"ما تباين المجتمع للقيم 1، 3، 5؟","En":"What is the population variance of the values 1, 3, 5?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التباين السكاني متوسط مربعات الانحرافات عن المتوسط.","En":"Population variance averages squared deviations from the population mean."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتوسط (1+3+5)/3=3؛ الانحرافات −2 و0 و2.","En":"The mean is (1+3+5)/3=3; deviations are −2, 0 and 2."},{"Ar":"مربعاتها 4 و0 و4؛ نجمع 8 ونقسم على عدد المجتمع 3.","En":"Their squares are 4, 0 and 4; sum to 8 and divide by population size 3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac83$","En":"$\\frac83$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل مقام تباين العينة N−1.","En":"Do not use the sample-variance denominator N−1."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac1N\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\mu=3,\\quad \\sigma^2=\\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\\frac83$","En":"$\\mu=3,\\quad \\sigma^2=\\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\\frac83$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times(8/3)=8$","En":"$3\\times(8/3)=8$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":35,"PrimarySkillId":54,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب المتوسط الحسابي أولاً.","En":"Calculate the mean first."},{"Ar":"ربّع الانحرافات واجمعها ثم اقسم على عدد المشاهدات.","En":"Square the deviations, sum, and divide by the population size."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"التباين السكاني متوسط مربعات الانحرافات عن المتوسط.","En":"Population variance averages squared deviations from the population mean."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتوسط (1+3+5)/3=3؛ الانحرافات −2 و0 و2.","En":"The mean is (1+3+5)/3=3; deviations are −2, 0 and 2."},{"Ar":"مربعاتها 4 و0 و4؛ نجمع 8 ونقسم على عدد المجتمع 3.","En":"Their squares are 4, 0 and 4; sum to 8 and divide by population size 3."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$\\frac83$","En":"$\\frac83$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تستعمل مقام تباين العينة N−1.","En":"Do not use the sample-variance denominator N−1."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac1N\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$\\mu=3,\\quad \\sigma^2=\\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\\frac83$","En":"$\\mu=3,\\quad \\sigma^2=\\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\\frac83$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$3\\times(8/3)=8$","En":"$3\\times(8/3)=8$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 ينتج من القسمة على 2 وفق تباين العينة لا المجتمع.","En":"4 divides by 2 as in sample rather than population variance."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8 مجموع المربعات دون قسمة.","En":"8 is the squared-deviation sum without averaging."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"8/6 يقسم على ضعف عدد القيم.","En":"8/6 divides by twice the population size."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$التباين السكاني متوسط مربعات الانحرافات عن المتوسط.

$\sigma^2=\frac1N\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. المتوسط (1+3+5)/3=3؛ الانحرافات −2 و0 و2.

2. مربعاتها 4 و0 و4؛ نجمع 8 ونقسم على عدد المجتمع 3.

$\mu=3,\quad \sigma^2=\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\frac83$

$\frac83$ بلا وحدة قياس

$3\times(8/3)=8$

لا تستعمل مقام تباين العينة N−1.$mw$,$mw$Population variance averages squared deviations from the population mean.

$\sigma^2=\frac1N\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. The mean is (1+3+5)/3=3; deviations are −2, 0 and 2.

2. Their squares are 4, 0 and 4; sum to 8 and divide by population size 3.

$\mu=3,\quad \sigma^2=\frac{(1-3)^2+(3-3)^2+(5-3)^2}{3}=\frac83$

$\frac83$ Dimensionless

$3\times(8/3)=8$

Do not use the sample-variance denominator N−1.$mw$),
(690,642,$mw$42B029D4423397212FA3604391FD18BA6FB03C9E22CD30B31422B8F64C483BDF$mw$,$mw$09309e4fc57e868dff985dca2f83fffe$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":642,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":35,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"حساب التباين لمجموعة متناظرة من القيم","TitleEn":"Calculate variance for evenly spaced data","QuestionTextAr":"احسب تباين المجتمع للقيم 2، 4، 6، 8.","QuestionTextEn":"Find the population variance of 2, 4, 6, 8.","DetailedSolutionAr":"المتوسط 5 ومجموع مربعات الفروق 9 + 1 + 1 + 9 = 20. التباين = 20 ÷ 4 = 5.","DetailedSolutionEn":"The mean is 5. The squared deviations total 9 + 1 + 1 + 9 = 20; population variance is 20 ÷ 4 = 5.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2557,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"4","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2558,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"5","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2559,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2560,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"20","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب متوسط المجتمع أولاً.","En":"Calculate the population mean first."},{"Ar":"ربّع فروق القيم عن المتوسط واجمعها واقسم على عدد القيم لا عددها ناقص واحد.","En":"Square deviations from the mean, sum them, and divide by the population size, not one less."}],"Title":{"Ar":"حساب التباين لمجموعة متناظرة من القيم","En":"Calculate variance for evenly spaced data"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"4 عدد القيم وليس التباين.","En":"4 is the population size, not variance."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"4"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"5"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"6 لا ينتج من 20/4.","En":"6 does not equal 20/4."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"20 مجموع المربعات قبل القسمة.","En":"20 is the sum of squares before averaging."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"20"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"احسب تباين المجتمع للقيم 2، 4، 6، 8.","En":"Find the population variance of 2, 4, 6, 8."},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قانون تباين المجتمع: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2$، والمقام هنا 4 لا 3.","En":"Population variance formula: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2$; divide by 4, not 3."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتوسط (2+4+6+8)/4=5؛ الانحرافات −3 و−1 و1 و3.","En":"The mean is (2+4+6+8)/4=5; deviations are −3, −1, 1 and 3."},{"Ar":"مجموع مربعاتها 9+1+1+9=20؛ نقسم على 4 فنحصل على 5.","En":"Squared deviations sum to 9+1+1+9=20; divide by 4 to get 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"استخدم حجم المجتمع لا حجم العينة ناقص واحد.","En":"Use population size, not sample size minus one."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(9+1+1+9)/4$","En":"$(9+1+1+9)/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مجموع مربعات الفروق 20؛ بقسمته على 4 نحصل على 5.","En":"Squared deviations sum to 20; dividing by 4 gives 5."}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":35,"PrimarySkillId":54,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"احسب متوسط المجتمع أولاً.","En":"Calculate the population mean first."},{"Ar":"ربّع فروق القيم عن المتوسط واجمعها واقسم على عدد القيم لا عددها ناقص واحد.","En":"Square deviations from the mean, sum them, and divide by the population size, not one less."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قانون تباين المجتمع: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2$، والمقام هنا 4 لا 3.","En":"Population variance formula: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2$; divide by 4, not 3."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"المتوسط (2+4+6+8)/4=5؛ الانحرافات −3 و−1 و1 و3.","En":"The mean is (2+4+6+8)/4=5; deviations are −3, −1, 1 and 3."},{"Ar":"مجموع مربعاتها 9+1+1+9=20؛ نقسم على 4 فنحصل على 5.","En":"Squared deviations sum to 9+1+1+9=20; divide by 4 to get 5."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$5$","En":"$5$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"استخدم حجم المجتمع لا حجم العينة ناقص واحد.","En":"Use population size, not sample size minus one."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(9+1+1+9)/4$","En":"$(9+1+1+9)/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"مجموع مربعات الفروق 20؛ بقسمته على 4 نحصل على 5.","En":"Squared deviations sum to 20; dividing by 4 gives 5."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"4 عدد القيم وليس التباين.","En":"4 is the population size, not variance."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"6 لا ينتج من 20/4.","En":"6 does not equal 20/4."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"20 مجموع المربعات قبل القسمة.","En":"20 is the sum of squares before averaging."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قانون تباين المجتمع: $\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\mu)^2$، والمقام هنا 4 لا 3.

$\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. المتوسط (2+4+6+8)/4=5؛ الانحرافات −3 و−1 و1 و3.

2. مجموع مربعاتها 9+1+1+9=20؛ نقسم على 4 فنحصل على 5.

$(9+1+1+9)/4$

$5$ بلا وحدة قياس

مجموع مربعات الفروق 20؛ بقسمته على 4 نحصل على 5.

استخدم حجم المجتمع لا حجم العينة ناقص واحد.$mw$,$mw$Population variance formula: $\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\mu)^2$; divide by 4, not 3.

$\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum_{i=1}^{N}(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. The mean is (2+4+6+8)/4=5; deviations are −3, −1, 1 and 3.

2. Squared deviations sum to 9+1+1+9=20; divide by 4 to get 5.

$(9+1+1+9)/4$

$5$ Dimensionless

Squared deviations sum to 20; dividing by 4 gives 5.

Use population size, not sample size minus one.$mw$),
