gma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2$. انعدام الفروق يعني تبايناً صفرياً.","En":"Population variance formula: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2$. Zero deviations give zero variance."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جميع القيم 7، لذا المتوسط 7 أيضاً.","En":"All values are 7, so the mean is also 7."},{"Ar":"كل انحراف يساوي صفر، ومتوسط مربعات الأصفار صفر.","En":"Every deviation is zero, and the average of their squares is zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"التباين ليس المتوسط ولا مربعه.","En":"Variance is not the mean or its square."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(0+0+0+0)/4$","En":"$(0+0+0+0)/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"القيم متطابقة فلا يوجد تشتت.","En":"All observations are identical, so there is no spread."}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":35,"PrimarySkillId":54,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"قارن كل قيمة بالمتوسط الحسابي.","En":"Compare each observation with the arithmetic mean."},{"Ar":"طبّق قانون التباين على مربعات هذه الفروق.","En":"Apply the variance formula to the squared deviations."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"قانون تباين المجتمع: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2$. انعدام الفروق يعني تبايناً صفرياً.","En":"Population variance formula: $\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2$. Zero deviations give zero variance."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"جميع القيم 7، لذا المتوسط 7 أيضاً.","En":"All values are 7, so the mean is also 7."},{"Ar":"كل انحراف يساوي صفر، ومتوسط مربعات الأصفار صفر.","En":"Every deviation is zero, and the average of their squares is zero."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$0$","En":"$0$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"التباين ليس المتوسط ولا مربعه.","En":"Variance is not the mean or its square."},"FormulaLatex":"\\sigma^2=\\frac{1}{N}\\sum(x_i-\\mu)^2","Substitution":{"Ar":"$(0+0+0+0)/4$","En":"$(0+0+0+0)/4$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"القيم متطابقة فلا يوجد تشتت.","En":"All observations are identical, so there is no spread."}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"1 يفترض تشتتاً غير موجود.","En":"1 assumes a spread that does not exist."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"7 هو المتوسط لا التباين.","En":"7 is the mean, not variance."},"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"49 مربع القيمة نفسها، لا مربع انحرافها.","En":"49 squares the value rather than its deviation."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$قانون تباين المجتمع: $\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$. انعدام الفروق يعني تبايناً صفرياً.

$\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. جميع القيم 7، لذا المتوسط 7 أيضاً.

2. كل انحراف يساوي صفر، ومتوسط مربعات الأصفار صفر.

$(0+0+0+0)/4$

$0$ بلا وحدة قياس

القيم متطابقة فلا يوجد تشتت.

التباين ليس المتوسط ولا مربعه.$mw$,$mw$Population variance formula: $\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$. Zero deviations give zero variance.

$\sigma^2=\frac{1}{N}\sum(x_i-\mu)^2$

1. All values are 7, so the mean is also 7.

2. Every deviation is zero, and the average of their squares is zero.

$(0+0+0+0)/4$

$0$ Dimensionless

All observations are identical, so there is no spread.

Variance is not the mean or its square.$mw$),
(692,644,$mw$ADD04FAACD9DA436E10E5C5E8B6DDEB89FF61654FDDED0F997F921455DDB389E$mw$,$mw$6fc1c179699224d79de78d8598a1d180$mw$,$mw$$mw$,$mw${"Id":644,"StageId":3,"CategoryId":35,"Points":10,"TitleAr":"معرفة تأثير ضرب كل البيانات بثابت على التباين","TitleEn":"Reason about how scaling data affects population variance","QuestionTextAr":"تباين المجتمع للقيم 1، 2، 3 يساوي 2/3. إذا ضربنا كل قيمة في 3، فما تباين القيم الجديدة؟","QuestionTextEn":"The population variance of 1, 2, 3 is 2/3. If every value is multiplied by 3, what is the new variance?","DetailedSolutionAr":"عند ضرب البيانات في 3 تتضاعف الفروق ثلاث مرات ومربعاتها تسع مرات؛ التباين الجديد = 9 × 2/3 = 6.","DetailedSolutionEn":"Scaling every value by 3 multiplies each squared deviation by 9. New variance = 9 × 2/3 = 6.","YoutubeSolutionUrl":null,"EditorialDetailsJson":null,"Options":[{"Id":2565,"Order":1,"LatexCode":"2","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2566,"Order":2,"LatexCode":"3","IsCorrect":false},{"Id":2567,"Order":3,"LatexCode":"6","IsCorrect":true},{"Id":2568,"Order":4,"LatexCode":"18","IsCorrect":false}]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"Hints":[{"Ar":"التباين يستعمل مربعات الانحرافات.","En":"Variance uses squared deviations."},{"Ar":"اضرب التباين الأصلي بمربع عامل التكبير.","En":"Multiply the original variance by the square of the scaling factor."}],"Title":{"Ar":"معرفة تأثير ضرب كل البيانات بثابت على التباين","En":"Reason about how scaling data affects population variance"},"Points":10,"Options":[{"Reason":{"Ar":"2 يضرب التباين في 3 بدلاً من 9.","En":"2 scales variance by 3 instead of 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"2"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"3 هو عامل تغيير القيم لا التباين الجديد.","En":"3 is the value scaling factor, not the new variance."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"3"},{"Reason":null,"ErrorType":"","IsCorrect":true,"LatexCode":"6"},{"Reason":{"Ar":"18 يضرب 2/3 في 27 لا 9.","En":"18 multiplies 2/3 by 27 rather than 9."},"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","IsCorrect":false,"LatexCode":"18"}],"StageId":3,"Question":{"Ar":"تباين المجتمع للقيم 1، 2، 3 يساوي 2/3. إذا ضربنا كل قيمة في 3، فما تباين القيم الجديدة؟","En":"The population variance of 1, 2, 3 is 2/3. If every value is multiplied by 3, what is the new variance?"},"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند ضرب كل القيم بثابت يتضاعف التباين بمربع الثابت.","En":"Scaling all values by a constant scales variance by its square."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند ضرب كل قيمة في 3 يضرب كل انحراف عن المتوسط في 3.","En":"Multiplying every value by 3 multiplies every deviation from its mean by 3."},{"Ar":"مربعات الانحراف تتضاعف بعامل $3^2=9$؛ التباين الجديد $9(2/3)=6$.","En":"Squared deviations scale by $3^2=9$; new variance is $9(2/3)=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب التباين في العامل الخطي فقط.","En":"Do not scale variance by the linear factor alone."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{Var}(aX)=a^2\\operatorname{Var}(X)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$3^2\\cdot\\frac23=6$","En":"$3^2\\cdot\\frac23=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$","En":"$\\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$"}},"TrackIds":[11],"CategoryId":35,"PrimarySkillId":54,"DifficultyLevel":1,"SecondarySkillIds":[]}$mw$::jsonb,$mw${"DifficultyLevel":1,"Hints":[{"Ar":"التباين يستعمل مربعات الانحرافات.","En":"Variance uses squared deviations."},{"Ar":"اضرب التباين الأصلي بمربع عامل التكبير.","En":"Multiply the original variance by the square of the scaling factor."}],"Solution":{"Idea":{"Ar":"عند ضرب كل القيم بثابت يتضاعف التباين بمربع الثابت.","En":"Scaling all values by a constant scales variance by its square."},"Unit":{"Ar":"بلا وحدة قياس","En":"Dimensionless"},"Steps":[{"Ar":"عند ضرب كل قيمة في 3 يضرب كل انحراف عن المتوسط في 3.","En":"Multiplying every value by 3 multiplies every deviation from its mean by 3."},{"Ar":"مربعات الانحراف تتضاعف بعامل $3^2=9$؛ التباين الجديد $9(2/3)=6$.","En":"Squared deviations scale by $3^2=9$; new variance is $9(2/3)=6$."}],"Result":{"Ar":"$6$","En":"$6$"},"CommonError":{"Ar":"لا تضرب التباين في العامل الخطي فقط.","En":"Do not scale variance by the linear factor alone."},"FormulaLatex":"\\operatorname{Var}(aX)=a^2\\operatorname{Var}(X)","Substitution":{"Ar":"$3^2\\cdot\\frac23=6$","En":"$3^2\\cdot\\frac23=6$"},"Verification":{"Ar":"$\\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$","En":"$\\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$"}},"Distractors":[{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"2 يضرب التباين في 3 بدلاً من 9.","En":"2 scales variance by 3 instead of 9."},"Order":1},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"3 هو عامل تغيير القيم لا التباين الجديد.","En":"3 is the value scaling factor, not the new variance."},"Order":2},{"ErrorType":"","Reason":null,"Order":3},{"ErrorType":"incorrect-option","Reason":{"Ar":"18 يضرب 2/3 في 27 لا 9.","En":"18 multiplies 2/3 by 27 rather than 9."},"Order":4}]}$mw$,$mw$عند ضرب كل القيم بثابت يتضاعف التباين بمربع الثابت.

$\operatorname{Var}(aX)=a^2\operatorname{Var}(X)$

1. عند ضرب كل قيمة في 3 يضرب كل انحراف عن المتوسط في 3.

2. مربعات الانحراف تتضاعف بعامل $3^2=9$؛ التباين الجديد $9(2/3)=6$.

$3^2\cdot\frac23=6$

$6$ بلا وحدة قياس

$\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$

لا تضرب التباين في العامل الخطي فقط.$mw$,$mw$Scaling all values by a constant scales variance by its square.

$\operatorname{Var}(aX)=a^2\operatorname{Var}(X)$

1. Multiplying every value by 3 multiplies every deviation from its mean by 3.

2. Squared deviations scale by $3^2=9$; new variance is $9(2/3)=6$.

$3^2\cdot\frac23=6$

$6$ Dimensionless

$\frac{(3-6)^2+(6-6)^2+(9-6)^2}3=6$

Do not scale variance by the linear factor alone.$mw$),
